1
00:02:33,687 --> 00:02:34,687
Place the logs properly,

2
00:02:35,312 --> 00:02:36,771
Now its caught fire.

3
00:02:41,437 --> 00:02:42,812
Alright then,
who’s going to tell a story today?

4
00:02:43,437 --> 00:02:46,687
Laddu…you were late.
You tell a story.

5
00:02:47,062 --> 00:02:48,687
Bro…
I don’t know any stories….

6
00:02:48,896 --> 00:02:51,562
But when you mention being late,
I remember this thing

7
00:03:03,812 --> 00:03:06,687
3-4 days ago,
a new boy joined our school.

8
00:03:09,937 --> 00:03:11,271
Oye leave the bicycle!
Run!

9
00:03:27,062 --> 00:03:30,312
Hey…hello…..yes you!
Come here.

10
00:03:31,062 --> 00:03:32,062
COME HERE!

11
00:03:38,146 --> 00:03:40,187
What are the school timings?
- 9.

12
00:03:40,312 --> 00:03:42,687
9 o’clock?
School starts at 9, eh?!

13
00:03:43,146 --> 00:03:45,062
We just happen to like arriving
half an hour early, don’t we?

14
00:03:45,937 --> 00:03:48,687
Now then….let me set
your watch right…c’mon now!

15
00:03:50,521 --> 00:03:52,937
C’mon…
move along!

16
00:04:12,562 --> 00:04:15,687
Alright….the last chapter
is now done. Syllabus complete!

17
00:04:16,896 --> 00:04:17,687
Sir…
May I come in?

18
00:04:20,646 --> 00:04:21,312
And who are you?

19
00:04:21,646 --> 00:04:23,437
Sir, new admission.
It’s my first day today.

20
00:04:23,812 --> 00:04:24,687
New admission?!

21
00:04:25,437 --> 00:04:26,396
In September?

22
00:04:27,062 --> 00:04:29,437
Bro, you aren’t just late for the class;
You are late for school (year) too!

23
00:04:30,146 --> 00:04:32,062
Sir, actually I have
come from very far.

24
00:04:32,896 --> 00:04:34,937
Are you coming from another planet
that you are reaching in September?!

25
00:04:35,771 --> 00:04:36,062
HEYY!!!

26
00:04:38,562 --> 00:04:39,187
Get in!

27
00:04:43,271 --> 00:04:44,521
And raise your hands and stand!

28
00:04:46,646 --> 00:04:50,021
Look son…the horses who lag behind
end up getting whipped the most.

29
00:04:50,187 --> 00:04:51,187
And then only do
they run in the race.

30
00:04:51,646 --> 00:04:55,187
C’MON! Now you all get ready too.
Let’s revise the first chapter.

31
00:04:55,437 --> 00:04:58,271
So tell me…The Battle of Plassey was
fought between who and who?

32
00:05:06,146 --> 00:05:06,812
Chanakya…!

33
00:05:10,562 --> 00:05:12,146
Sorry sir…haven’t been
able to do any revision.

34
00:05:12,521 --> 00:05:13,896
This is the state in
the first chapter itself…

35
00:05:14,021 --> 00:05:16,187
Well, get ready for some ‘service’.

36
00:05:18,562 --> 00:05:19,312
Sir! Sir!

37
00:05:19,521 --> 00:05:21,062
Hey!
You keep both your hands raised!

38
00:05:21,271 --> 00:05:22,437
And you, bring forth your hand.

39
00:05:22,812 --> 00:05:27,062
Sir! Sir!...Sir, it was fought between
the East India Company and the Nawab of Bengal.

40
00:05:29,687 --> 00:05:32,146
When?
- Sir, 23 June, 1757.

41
00:05:32,312 --> 00:05:34,187
Who won?
- East India Company.

42
00:05:36,771 --> 00:05:38,562
Vidwaan took this to heart.

43
00:05:39,146 --> 00:05:41,812
[Dramatically] “Who was the first to
establish their capital at Delhi?”

44
00:05:42,187 --> 00:05:44,437
He kept shooting arrows
of question after question…

45
00:05:45,187 --> 00:05:46,436
“Tomar Rajputs.”

46
00:05:46,437 --> 00:05:48,687
And the new boy…
shot arrows of answers

47
00:05:49,896 --> 00:05:52,771
As if our classroom turned
into the battlefield of Plassey!

48
00:05:58,021 --> 00:05:59,771
All is fair in love and war…

49
00:05:59,937 --> 00:06:02,187
so Vidwaan gradually
stooped down to cheating.

50
00:06:02,396 --> 00:06:04,686
“After whom is
the country of ‘Bhaarat’ named?”

51
00:06:04,687 --> 00:06:05,646
“This is out of syllabus!!!”

52
00:06:06,312 --> 00:06:07,437
“After King Bharat.”

53
00:06:14,187 --> 00:06:15,521
Vidwaan’s arrow turned to ash!

54
00:06:20,437 --> 00:06:22,937
And for the first time,
we saw him smile.

55
00:06:26,187 --> 00:06:27,896
“God you are great!”

56
00:06:30,521 --> 00:06:31,687
“Hail Lord Ram!”

57
00:06:32,312 --> 00:06:34,562
And after that,
there was one attack after another!

58
00:06:41,646 --> 00:06:44,062
But the boy didn’t give up.
He fought; and he won

59
00:06:44,812 --> 00:06:48,187
The whole class had realized that
there was something special about him.

60
00:06:49,812 --> 00:06:51,187
But there was one problem…

61
00:06:51,312 --> 00:06:53,937
He’s too proud.
He thinks we are not equal to him.

62
00:06:54,187 --> 00:06:55,437
Poor thing’s shy.

63
00:06:57,562 --> 00:07:00,271
He used to keep to himself;
didn’t talk to anyone.

64
00:07:00,396 --> 00:07:03,646
And the class began to feel
- What if he is an ISI agent?

65
00:07:05,187 --> 00:07:06,937
There was a bit of a suspense.

66
00:07:10,521 --> 00:07:11,562
I took it for a couple of days,

67
00:07:12,812 --> 00:07:14,312
but by the 3rd day,
I couldn't take it anymore.

68
00:07:14,646 --> 00:07:16,562
No mom…I am not feeling hungry.
I’ll eat later.

69
00:07:19,187 --> 00:07:20,937
He’s started worrying
about his studies.

70
00:07:21,062 --> 00:07:24,396
Yeah sure…Worry!
Must have eaten something outside.

71
00:07:39,562 --> 00:07:42,312
I thought, now this
can’t continue like this.

72
00:07:46,937 --> 00:07:47,687
Churan (herbal digestive)...

73
00:07:48,187 --> 00:07:51,687
it sharpens the mind!
But yours already is.

74
00:07:53,021 --> 00:07:53,562
Thanks.

75
00:07:55,187 --> 00:07:57,771
Coming for lunch?
- No, I have my lunch at home.

76
00:07:58,562 --> 00:08:00,936
After lunch, we will
be going to the canteen;

77
00:08:00,937 --> 00:08:02,936
...to have samosas.
Wanna come?

78
00:08:02,937 --> 00:08:04,146
No. Revision is still left.

79
00:08:06,937 --> 00:08:07,437
Good!

80
00:08:10,646 --> 00:08:12,186
Bro, come straight
to the point already!

81
00:08:12,187 --> 00:08:13,562
Why are you messing
with our digestion?

82
00:08:13,687 --> 00:08:15,771
That day I had sworn
on Goddess Kali…

83
00:08:16,771 --> 00:08:18,562
…that, today I’ll find out for sure.

84
00:08:19,187 --> 00:08:20,562
Why don’t you talk to anyone?

85
00:08:20,896 --> 00:08:21,687
No…nothing like that.

86
00:08:22,437 --> 00:08:24,062
The whole class says…
- What?

87
00:08:24,812 --> 00:08:26,062
…that you’re an ISI agent.

88
00:08:27,521 --> 00:08:28,021
- Are you ?

89
00:08:29,687 --> 00:08:30,062
Then ?

90
00:08:33,062 --> 00:08:34,812
It’s a long story,
shall I tell you tomorrow?

91
00:08:36,937 --> 00:08:41,771
And yes, come a bit early.
I cannot tell it in front of everyone.

92
00:08:59,437 --> 00:09:02,686
New Caption

93
00:09:10,687 --> 00:09:12,271
There’s still an hour for school to start.

94
00:09:12,521 --> 00:09:14,562
I know! I know!
But I can’t study well at home.

95
00:09:17,187 --> 00:09:18,896
the mood to study
is best right here.

96
00:09:58,437 --> 00:10:01,062
Sure you won’t tell anyone?
Else it will be trouble.

97
00:10:01,312 --> 00:10:01,937
Trouble?

98
00:10:02,812 --> 00:10:03,687
You won’t tell,
would you?

99
00:10:04,187 --> 00:10:07,312
Not at all! You assume that
I never even heard it.

100
00:10:07,687 --> 00:10:09,686
Even if by mistake if anyone found out…

101
00:10:09,687 --> 00:10:11,312
I swear on Vidya (knowledge);
on Dharti Mata (mother Earth)

102
00:10:11,562 --> 00:10:14,187
swear on Bhagwan (God)...
won’t tell anyone.

103
00:10:27,437 --> 00:10:28,146
Then ?

104
00:10:29,687 --> 00:10:31,562
What is your age?
- 18.

105
00:10:32,437 --> 00:10:33,021
19.

106
00:10:33,937 --> 00:10:34,937
Yours?
- 20.

107
00:10:35,271 --> 00:10:36,937
And yours ?
- 19.

108
00:10:37,396 --> 00:10:39,271
Sorry bro, I won’t be able
to tell you anything further;

109
00:10:39,812 --> 00:10:41,146
else there will be trouble.

110
00:10:42,146 --> 00:10:43,312
Damn, then why did
you tell us all this?

111
00:10:45,062 --> 00:10:46,186
Told you by mistake.

112
00:10:46,187 --> 00:10:48,521
Now you will have to
tell us the whole thing.

113
00:10:48,646 --> 00:10:50,562
Sorry friends,
don’t force me.

114
00:10:51,562 --> 00:10:52,812
Alright,
we’ll meet tomorrow.

115
00:10:53,187 --> 00:10:54,937
How will you run away ?
Catch him...

116
00:11:03,687 --> 00:11:06,312
Every 2-3 months,
I have to change schools.

117
00:11:07,146 --> 00:11:09,312
We cannot stay at one place for long.

118
00:11:10,437 --> 00:11:12,396
And we don’t tell this to anyone either.

119
00:11:13,812 --> 00:11:16,811
And if someone found
out where we live…

120
00:11:16,812 --> 00:11:19,937
Hey Bro! Planning to
blow up the school or what?!

121
00:11:22,312 --> 00:11:25,937
If anyone found out,
then Earth could get attacked!

122
00:11:26,437 --> 00:11:27,187
Attack?!

123
00:11:29,521 --> 00:11:31,312
Ours is not a normal family.

124
00:11:33,021 --> 00:11:35,646
My grandpa has some powers.

125
00:11:37,312 --> 00:11:38,187
What powers?

126
00:11:39,687 --> 00:11:41,562
Hey!
Stand up!

127
00:11:43,562 --> 00:11:44,312
What’s your problem?

128
00:11:44,562 --> 00:11:46,396
Neither do you study yourself
nor do you let anyone else study.

129
00:11:46,771 --> 00:11:47,396
Get out!

130
00:11:47,937 --> 00:11:49,021
Sir, just a minute.

131
00:11:50,312 --> 00:11:51,146
What kind of power?

132
00:11:51,312 --> 00:11:53,312
HEY!
Didn’t you hear…get out!

133
00:11:53,521 --> 00:11:54,937
Bro tell me,
what kind of power?

134
00:11:55,312 --> 00:11:56,312
[with reverb]
Superpower!

135
00:12:08,687 --> 00:12:10,312
My grandpa has superpowers.

136
00:12:11,187 --> 00:12:13,562
As in…he can fly in the air
as high as he wishes…

137
00:12:17,937 --> 00:12:19,646
…can lift loads as heavy as can be.

138
00:12:24,021 --> 00:12:24,937
Like Superman?

139
00:12:26,187 --> 00:12:27,062
That’s my Grandpa for you.

140
00:12:27,396 --> 00:12:29,187
Superman?
- Superhero.

141
00:12:36,812 --> 00:12:39,896
We just doesn’t tell anyone.
Has to remain a secret.

142
00:12:41,937 --> 00:12:45,187
He takes great responsibility;
must use his powers for the right,

143
00:12:45,437 --> 00:12:46,687
else the powers will be lost.

144
00:12:50,187 --> 00:12:53,937
Whenever there’s a fight,
he hits so much that one loses count;

145
00:12:54,396 --> 00:12:56,062
the aliens shiver on his mention.

146
00:12:57,812 --> 00:12:59,896
Grandpa is famous across
planets far far away.

147
00:13:00,562 --> 00:13:02,437
He has a bounty of
crores on his head.

148
00:13:02,937 --> 00:13:07,312
When alien kids don’t sleep at night;
you know what their mothers tell them?

149
00:13:07,562 --> 00:13:08,562
You better sleep kid.

150
00:13:09,187 --> 00:13:09,687
or what?

151
00:13:10,271 --> 00:13:12,562
The Great Grand Superhero will come!

152
00:13:21,521 --> 00:13:24,811
The Great Grand Superhero!

153
00:13:24,812 --> 00:13:30,562
The Great Grand Superhero!
Part A: The Arrival of the Aliens

154
00:13:30,896 --> 00:13:31,646
Wow Dude!

155
00:13:32,062 --> 00:13:35,896
This should be known to the whole class,
the whole school, the whole town!

156
00:13:36,062 --> 00:13:37,687
No bro, it can’t be revealed.

157
00:13:38,021 --> 00:13:40,812
If we told anyone,
then powers are lost.

158
00:13:43,771 --> 00:13:44,437
What happened?

159
00:13:44,896 --> 00:13:46,271
Oh we are done for!

160
00:13:46,396 --> 00:13:48,521
Why?
- But you told me everything!

161
00:13:49,646 --> 00:13:53,021
No bro, powers are not lost
if it's told to kids.

162
00:13:53,687 --> 00:13:55,062
The issue is for ages 18 and above.

163
00:13:55,271 --> 00:13:57,312
If elders are told,
then the powers are lost.

164
00:13:59,812 --> 00:14:01,187
Okay bye!
See you tomorrow.

165
00:14:02,521 --> 00:14:05,437
I am coming too
to see your home.

166
00:14:06,062 --> 00:14:07,562
My home is quite far.

167
00:14:07,812 --> 00:14:09,562
Tch! What do I have to do!

168
00:14:09,687 --> 00:14:12,062
Studies will be taken care of by you
and the battles by Grandpa.

169
00:14:12,521 --> 00:14:13,937
I am tension-free!

170
00:14:37,271 --> 00:14:40,271
We are staying here; for now,
so that no one gets suspicious.

171
00:14:41,437 --> 00:14:42,187
Alright, bye!

172
00:14:44,312 --> 00:14:45,312
Deepu!
- Yeah?

173
00:14:46,187 --> 00:14:46,937
Thanks!

174
00:14:47,437 --> 00:14:47,812
Why ?

175
00:14:48,646 --> 00:14:52,687
Your Grandpa is such a big Superhero
and still you made me your friend.

176
00:15:16,062 --> 00:15:16,812
Hey Deepu…

177
00:15:19,437 --> 00:15:20,562
Deepu... you arrived right on time son.

178
00:15:21,062 --> 00:15:22,521
Come here,
take this bucket inside.

179
00:15:23,437 --> 00:15:24,062
Back’s busted.

180
00:15:24,937 --> 00:15:25,937
C’mon now, come down.

181
00:15:32,062 --> 00:15:33,062
Come now.

182
00:15:48,562 --> 00:15:50,312
There’s a lizard inside.
- WHAT?!

183
00:15:53,562 --> 00:15:56,187
Hey…hey listen…

184
00:15:58,771 --> 00:15:59,811
I’d shooed it off yesterday.

185
00:15:59,812 --> 00:16:01,562
If you had shooed it off then
how come it’s back?!

186
00:16:01,937 --> 00:16:03,186
Grandpa, I am very tired.

187
00:16:03,187 --> 00:16:04,812
I understand you are tired.

188
00:16:05,062 --> 00:16:08,521
But if the water gets cold,
then you’ll have to heat it and bring it again.

189
00:16:08,687 --> 00:16:10,521
I won’t go.
You will have to bring it.

190
00:16:12,187 --> 00:16:14,896
Come come,
come now, son.

191
00:16:24,771 --> 00:16:28,937
Shoo! Shoo! Go!
Go!

192
00:16:38,271 --> 00:16:38,771
It’s gone.

193
00:16:40,937 --> 00:16:42,062
Gone?
- YES.

194
00:16:42,271 --> 00:16:43,687
Gone out?
- Yes! Yes!

195
00:16:43,812 --> 00:16:46,812
You sure?
- Next time I will take a camera inside.

196
00:16:58,312 --> 00:17:01,687
His slippers are worn out and old.

197
00:17:03,187 --> 00:17:06,562
His story has never been told.

198
00:17:08,062 --> 00:17:12,062
He is the protector of every lane.

199
00:17:13,021 --> 00:17:16,146
Every galaxy echoes his name.

200
00:17:17,937 --> 00:17:19,646
Why are you afraid of lizards?

201
00:17:20,812 --> 00:17:22,062
It’s a long story.

202
00:17:23,437 --> 00:17:26,646
Once my father had Malaria…
platelets down,

203
00:17:26,771 --> 00:17:28,062
was almost about to die.

204
00:17:29,021 --> 00:17:30,271
Then I decided...

205
00:17:30,937 --> 00:17:32,896
He will make you weep !

206
00:17:33,312 --> 00:17:35,437
One hell of a guy, this dude.

207
00:17:35,812 --> 00:17:38,021
Enemies your grandpa’s “in the hood”.

208
00:17:38,146 --> 00:17:40,521
Transcending every storm...

209
00:17:40,646 --> 00:17:42,812
Shattering every norm...

210
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:45,312
The bird soars in fight

211
00:17:46,646 --> 00:17:48,896
The mosquitoes were terrorized.

212
00:17:49,312 --> 00:17:51,271
They packed their bahs and fled.

213
00:17:52,437 --> 00:17:54,771
And this caused a tension among the lizards.

214
00:17:55,271 --> 00:17:56,562
Their kids were starving to death.

215
00:17:57,187 --> 00:18:01,146
Hope has found its way...

216
00:18:01,937 --> 00:18:05,687
Troubles have no place to say

217
00:18:06,562 --> 00:18:10,520
He thinks
“Can all this be true ?”

218
00:18:10,521 --> 00:18:14,187
It might feel like a dream to him too.

219
00:18:14,437 --> 00:18:15,936
ATTACK!

220
00:18:15,937 --> 00:18:17,645
And since then you
have been scared of lizards?

221
00:18:17,646 --> 00:18:19,812
Naah…
it’s a long story.

222
00:18:20,521 --> 00:18:21,937
Hey, hey!

223
00:18:22,146 --> 00:18:24,771
If you wish to know the story then listen
to the whole story, else don’t ask!!

224
00:18:24,896 --> 00:18:26,312
Same old stories,
repeated again and again...

225
00:18:34,312 --> 00:18:35,812
Everybody understood...?
Sir…

226
00:18:36,937 --> 00:18:37,771
May I come in?

227
00:18:38,271 --> 00:18:39,312
Be punctual!

228
00:18:43,812 --> 00:18:46,021
Everyone... Chapter 21,
Couplets by Rahim.

229
00:18:46,396 --> 00:18:49,396
Open your books, first couplet is...

230
00:18:50,021 --> 00:18:55,436
Rahim says, do not disregard
or throw away insignificant things

231
00:18:55,437 --> 00:18:57,312
just because you see important things.

232
00:18:57,896 --> 00:19:00,896
A sword cannot replace a needle
where a needle is needed.

233
00:19:02,271 --> 00:19:02,812
HEY!!

234
00:19:03,312 --> 00:19:04,186
The class is happening on this side;

235
00:19:04,187 --> 00:19:05,812
what are you looking there for?
Look forward.

236
00:19:07,521 --> 00:19:09,187
Bro, you didn’t tell anyone;
did you?

237
00:19:09,396 --> 00:19:11,937
Don’t worry, everyone is
below the age of 18.

238
00:19:13,021 --> 00:19:16,021
It’s not that…what if someone blurts it
out to a teacher or family member?

239
00:19:16,562 --> 00:19:18,312
I have made them anty-shanty promise.

240
00:19:20,021 --> 00:19:21,812
Understood kids?

241
00:19:22,937 --> 00:19:27,437
The aliens were terrorized.
Wherever they went, there was Grandpa.

242
00:19:27,562 --> 00:19:28,646
And then Grandpas said-

243
00:19:28,812 --> 00:19:33,520
‘Son! I’ll have to treat you differently.
You won’t get it this way.’

244
00:19:33,521 --> 00:19:37,020
Then he grabbed him like this
and dragged him to his own planet

245
00:19:37,021 --> 00:19:38,645
and then a punch here and a punch there.

246
00:19:38,646 --> 00:19:40,561
Punch here…punch there….

247
00:19:40,562 --> 00:19:41,396
It’s further ahead…

248
00:19:42,437 --> 00:19:44,936
Made a full rail (train) of him…
what did he make?

249
00:19:44,937 --> 00:19:46,437
[in chorus] Train!

250
00:19:46,646 --> 00:19:47,187
Then?

251
00:19:47,312 --> 00:19:48,936
The alien said-
‘Sorry Grandpa’.

252
00:19:48,937 --> 00:19:52,311
Grandpa said-
‘Nope. Today you are done for son!’

253
00:19:52,312 --> 00:19:53,271
Was there gravity there?

254
00:19:54,146 --> 00:19:58,521
Yo…gravity is for people like us,
not for Superheroes!

255
00:19:59,562 --> 00:20:03,312
When the Superhero arrives,
science is left behind.

256
00:20:03,771 --> 00:20:05,186
Got it?!
[chorus mumbling] Hmmmm

257
00:20:05,187 --> 00:20:06,271
HEY!
Get out!!

258
00:20:08,396 --> 00:20:09,187
All of you get out!

259
00:20:09,396 --> 00:20:13,062
That’s it; that day the aliens had
sworn that they would come back.

260
00:20:13,687 --> 00:20:16,771
And they are to arrive today.
The battle must have started already.

261
00:20:19,437 --> 00:20:20,021
Roosters!!

262
00:20:21,062 --> 00:20:22,687
Will you ever get back to class
or will you lay eggs here itself!

263
00:20:22,937 --> 00:20:23,312
GET BACK!!
C’MON!

264
00:20:28,896 --> 00:20:30,562
Superhero has a principle.

265
00:20:30,937 --> 00:20:33,812
The one who punches first,
is the one who wins.

266
00:20:34,396 --> 00:20:37,312
He who is protected by God
cannot be killed by anyone!

267
00:20:39,896 --> 00:20:43,521
Grandpa has sworn that he will
deal with them for once and all.

268
00:21:11,271 --> 00:21:11,812
Whoa!!!

269
00:21:13,562 --> 00:21:15,311
Then he must get wounded as well, right?

270
00:21:15,312 --> 00:21:19,396
Bones get crushed!
But then, what to do?

271
00:21:20,312 --> 00:21:21,812
That’s the job of a Superhero.

272
00:21:22,437 --> 00:21:24,312
If there’s power,
there’s pain.

273
00:21:26,437 --> 00:21:28,312
At least now stop your
war against the lizard!

274
00:21:28,562 --> 00:21:30,437
You got away this time!
What if it got fractured?

275
00:21:31,271 --> 00:21:32,937
And at this age,
even surgery is not possible.

276
00:21:34,021 --> 00:21:35,521
I am prescribing some medicines.

277
00:21:36,312 --> 00:21:37,521
You must rest for a few days now.

278
00:21:39,687 --> 00:21:41,812
And yes, do not lift
any kind of weight.

279
00:21:43,646 --> 00:21:46,687
Is that mine?
- Yes. It is yours.

280
00:21:48,062 --> 00:21:48,687
For him.

281
00:21:49,396 --> 00:21:50,187
Dad,
we’ll head home?

282
00:21:56,437 --> 00:21:56,937
Bye !

283
00:21:57,646 --> 00:21:59,521
We are also coming!
Will get to meet Grandpa!

284
00:22:00,687 --> 00:22:02,437
Bro, if Grandpa finds out that...

285
00:22:02,812 --> 00:22:05,896
I have told you guys,
then he will parcel me to another planet.

286
00:22:06,562 --> 00:22:08,436
Don’t worry!
We will not come near your home.

287
00:22:08,437 --> 00:22:09,895
We will just glance from far away.
No one will be suspicious.

288
00:22:09,896 --> 00:22:10,646
[in chorus]
Yes, yes! Correct!

289
00:22:30,687 --> 00:22:32,812
You go in,
we will see from outside.

290
00:22:39,646 --> 00:22:41,146
Are you sure,
this is his house?

291
00:22:42,312 --> 00:22:43,937
Yes, this is the one he had told me.

292
00:22:46,187 --> 00:22:48,146
Where is the Superhero? Alien?

293
00:22:49,437 --> 00:22:50,812
Wait bro..they will come.

294
00:22:55,812 --> 00:22:57,646
Superhero?
- On a scooter?

295
00:22:57,812 --> 00:23:00,395
Superhero On a scooter?
Shouldn’t he be flying in?

296
00:23:00,396 --> 00:23:01,812
Looks like he’s returning from a fight.

297
00:23:04,521 --> 00:23:05,687
C’mon guys….
you have to leave.

298
00:23:05,896 --> 00:23:07,396
There has been an attack.
The aliens are here.

299
00:23:07,896 --> 00:23:10,021
They threw a train on Grandpa’s hand.

300
00:23:10,187 --> 00:23:13,187
Bro, if we could be of any help,
then do let us know.

301
00:23:14,437 --> 00:23:15,520
God help us…

302
00:23:15,521 --> 00:23:17,187
You won’t be able to
do anything. Now leave!!

303
00:23:30,521 --> 00:23:32,936
[News on TV] The situation
in Delhi is bad today as well.

304
00:23:32,937 --> 00:23:35,062
Pollution is in dire straits.

305
00:23:35,312 --> 00:23:40,936
As you can see, pollution is spreading like
an epedemic, it’s symptoms are everywhere.

306
00:23:40,937 --> 00:23:43,937
Papa, has there been any news of a train?

307
00:23:44,187 --> 00:23:45,395
No. What was it supposed to be?

308
00:23:45,396 --> 00:23:47,437
As in, someone might
have thrown a train.

309
00:23:48,562 --> 00:23:51,937
Did you do anything?
- Oh no! Was asking just like that.

310
00:23:52,062 --> 00:23:52,771
Tell me the truth.

311
00:23:53,271 --> 00:23:55,021
If you caused trouble
then I will break your teeth!

312
00:23:55,937 --> 00:23:57,896
That’s why aliens come here.
They know!

313
00:23:58,687 --> 00:24:01,686
It’s them who cause trouble
and some innocent gets blamed.

314
00:24:01,687 --> 00:24:03,771
[On TV] Hello friends!
We have got big news.

315
00:24:04,062 --> 00:24:06,686
The Railway ministry has decided to

316
00:24:06,687 --> 00:24:09,645
increase the fares per 20 kms by 1 rupee;

317
00:24:09,646 --> 00:24:16,146
80 paise for long distance trains
and 1 rupee 30 paise for AC trains.

318
00:24:16,646 --> 00:24:17,771
In response to this decision...

319
00:24:17,937 --> 00:24:20,771
protests have been see
in many places across the country.

320
00:24:21,021 --> 00:24:26,646
Today, some anti-social elements have tried
to vandalize trains and railway stations.

321
00:24:27,562 --> 00:24:29,937
What problem do the aliens
have with the railway fares?

322
00:24:30,937 --> 00:24:32,520
Alright, you take care.
I will be back in two days.

323
00:24:32,521 --> 00:24:33,271
Where are you going?

324
00:24:33,812 --> 00:24:34,937
Delhi. Alright...
I’ll miss my train…

325
00:24:35,146 --> 00:24:37,395
Oh no Dad!
Don’t go there. It’s dangerous.

326
00:24:37,396 --> 00:24:38,521
They are throwing trains there.

327
00:24:38,646 --> 00:24:40,812
Throwing trains?! Who?
- Aliens!!

328
00:24:41,896 --> 00:24:43,812
[laughing] Aliens!!

329
00:24:44,896 --> 00:24:46,395
No Dad…I won’t let you go!

330
00:24:46,396 --> 00:24:46,937
Hey...!!

331
00:24:47,146 --> 00:24:48,020
Won’t let you go!

332
00:24:48,021 --> 00:24:49,145
C’mon let go!
I’ll miss my train! Let go!

333
00:24:49,146 --> 00:24:49,895
Won’t let you go!

334
00:24:49,896 --> 00:24:50,936
Son, I am getting late
for my train….let go!

335
00:24:50,937 --> 00:24:52,145
Dad…there are aliens there!!

336
00:24:52,146 --> 00:24:53,561
Hey, let go!
Have you gone mad!!

337
00:24:53,562 --> 00:24:54,686
Let go!
I’ll miss my train! Let go!

338
00:24:54,687 --> 00:24:56,395
I’ll get a chocolate for you.

339
00:24:56,396 --> 00:24:58,062
Last night I watched all the news channels;

340
00:24:59,937 --> 00:25:04,396
read every newspaper
but your train news was mentioned nowhere!

341
00:25:04,687 --> 00:25:06,562
It’s all about pollution,
pollution, pollution.

342
00:25:13,396 --> 00:25:14,271
What do you think...?

343
00:25:14,562 --> 00:25:17,271
the Superhero and alien
battle happens in a boxing ring?

344
00:25:18,146 --> 00:25:20,146
The fights are so fearsome that...

345
00:25:20,687 --> 00:25:22,812
even they don’t realize
where they start to fight

346
00:25:23,021 --> 00:25:26,562
and where they reach
- one country to another

347
00:25:26,687 --> 00:25:28,896
from the Earth to Mars, Moon, Jupiter.

348
00:25:29,021 --> 00:25:31,812
Grandpa deliberately took
them to another planet,

349
00:25:32,062 --> 00:25:34,437
so that we,
WE don’t face any trouble.

350
00:25:35,437 --> 00:25:39,187
A person is doing so much for us
and we are looking for evidence?!

351
00:25:40,771 --> 00:25:41,937
C’mon now!
What’re you saying!?

352
00:25:43,312 --> 00:25:46,521
Sorry bro!
Please don’t tell this to Grandpa

353
00:25:47,062 --> 00:25:47,937
He’ll be hurt.

354
00:25:51,187 --> 00:25:53,937
Here…your newspapers!

355
00:26:08,646 --> 00:26:09,646
May I come in, Sir ?

356
00:26:30,687 --> 00:26:31,937
Why was everyone clapping?

357
00:26:33,187 --> 00:26:36,187
This is Chingi.
Her father was in the Army.

358
00:26:36,812 --> 00:26:41,062
She and her father were going somewhere
when a terrorist shot at her father.

359
00:26:41,437 --> 00:26:42,521
He fired back too.

360
00:26:43,812 --> 00:26:46,521
But soon he ran out of bullets.

361
00:26:48,312 --> 00:26:50,937
Chinki saw a gun a little way away.

362
00:26:51,896 --> 00:26:56,812
When she went to pick it up,
the terrorist shot at her leg.

363
00:26:58,437 --> 00:27:00,271
Really ?
- Yes.

364
00:27:01,062 --> 00:27:02,271
It was in the newspapers too!

365
00:27:02,812 --> 00:27:05,146
Next chapter- CLIMATE.

366
00:27:33,896 --> 00:27:36,312
Hello.
- Hello.

367
00:27:38,521 --> 00:27:39,562
May I help you?

368
00:27:40,646 --> 00:27:42,187
No-no…
I’ll take care of it. Thank you.

369
00:27:44,771 --> 00:27:45,937
I’ll help!

370
00:28:08,521 --> 00:28:10,437
C’mon! Attack!

371
00:28:26,396 --> 00:28:27,312
Shall I ring the bell?

372
00:28:28,187 --> 00:28:30,271
Will you write an application for this?
Just ring!

373
00:28:48,687 --> 00:28:54,771
We... notebook
Err…we..Deepu friends…class same.

374
00:28:57,146 --> 00:29:01,062
Namaste. We are Deepu’s friends;
from the same class.

375
00:29:01,312 --> 00:29:03,646
Deepu had forgotten his notebook
and we are here to return it.

376
00:29:04,562 --> 00:29:06,687
To return just one notebook
the whole class is here!

377
00:29:07,437 --> 00:29:08,062
Very good!

378
00:29:08,687 --> 00:29:10,187
I was in the middle of cleaning.
Will just wrap it up and come.

379
00:29:10,562 --> 00:29:13,271
Just wait for 2 mins.
I will be down.

380
00:29:18,937 --> 00:29:19,521
What happened?

381
00:29:21,187 --> 00:29:22,687
You had forgotten your notebook.

382
00:29:23,187 --> 00:29:25,562
Oh…okay…thank you, bye !
See you tomorrow in school.

383
00:29:32,062 --> 00:29:32,687
What now?

384
00:29:33,062 --> 00:29:36,062
Umm…Superhe…
Grandpa had said to meet before leaving.

385
00:29:36,396 --> 00:29:38,437
Oh yes, I know. But he’s asked
you to come back later.

386
00:29:38,896 --> 00:29:42,312
Here was a bit of an emergency
so he’s taken off directly from the terrace itself.

387
00:29:44,812 --> 00:29:45,896
Okay…Bye!

388
00:29:49,521 --> 00:29:50,687
We got late by just a little, bro.

389
00:29:58,062 --> 00:30:01,020
Hey Deepu! Open the door.
Your friends are here.

390
00:30:01,021 --> 00:30:01,562
Shhh…!!!

391
00:30:04,062 --> 00:30:05,312
[whispering] Come come…
- What ?

392
00:30:07,062 --> 00:30:07,896
Come.
- Hey..!

393
00:30:14,562 --> 00:30:17,812
Look at all their faces carefully;
scan them.

394
00:30:18,771 --> 00:30:25,146
They will follow you in the alleys, at the bus-stand,
at the train-station, on the road; everywhere!

395
00:30:25,562 --> 00:30:26,812
Will investigate you!

396
00:30:27,771 --> 00:30:28,312
Why ?

397
00:30:29,312 --> 00:30:31,562
I have sung your praises
a lot in front of them.

398
00:30:32,521 --> 00:30:33,562
What praises?

399
00:30:34,312 --> 00:30:38,312
That you have a lot of strength;
you can do anything!

400
00:30:39,062 --> 00:30:39,937
What all can I do?

401
00:30:40,062 --> 00:30:43,562
You can fly in the air;
lift very heavy objects;

402
00:30:43,937 --> 00:30:47,312
aliens-who live on other planets-
you can beat them up;

403
00:30:47,521 --> 00:30:51,646
in a nutshell- you are a Superhero!
Like Superman!

404
00:30:52,562 --> 00:30:53,562
Do they believe you?

405
00:30:54,396 --> 00:30:55,812
That’s why they are standing here.

406
00:30:56,062 --> 00:30:58,686
If I tell them that you are fighting with
the aliens now and will be back at night,

407
00:30:58,687 --> 00:31:00,146
then they will remain
standing here till night.

408
00:31:01,021 --> 00:31:01,562
What?

409
00:31:02,937 --> 00:31:04,270
One has to brag a little, else

410
00:31:04,271 --> 00:31:06,562
In spite of studying
so much and well, no one takes you seriously.

411
00:31:08,021 --> 00:31:10,937
Now you have to keep it in your mind that
you are a superhero; a Superhero!

412
00:31:11,312 --> 00:31:12,437
I’ll be back after
sending them away.

413
00:31:12,687 --> 00:31:17,395
Hey hey hey….
who told you that I am?

414
00:31:17,396 --> 00:31:17,812
What?

415
00:31:18,146 --> 00:31:19,646
A..err…Superhero.

416
00:31:19,771 --> 00:31:22,146
Oh it’s an old trick to
get settled in a new school.

417
00:31:22,396 --> 00:31:23,937
I AM a Superhero!

418
00:31:24,312 --> 00:31:25,312
That’s it…very good!

419
00:31:25,687 --> 00:31:29,312
If you meet them, then say the same thing
but with a little more confidence.

420
00:31:29,437 --> 00:31:30,437
I REALLY AM!

421
00:31:30,562 --> 00:31:32,645
But don’t tell anyone or
I will lose my powers!

422
00:31:32,646 --> 00:31:33,770
Already told!
So powers gone!

423
00:31:33,771 --> 00:31:35,186
Kids knowing is not a worry;

424
00:31:35,187 --> 00:31:37,562
it’s the adults-
age 18 and above is the issue.

425
00:31:38,312 --> 00:31:39,562
I said the same in class too!!

426
00:31:39,687 --> 00:31:42,562
I really am;
I am telling you I AM!

427
00:31:42,687 --> 00:31:45,646
Very good!
Say it with this same confidence. Bravo!

428
00:31:46,187 --> 00:31:49,521
Hey…I AM!
Hey…

429
00:31:56,812 --> 00:31:58,437
Still here?

430
00:31:59,187 --> 00:32:02,271
What if the fight ends earlier;
that’s why we were waiting.

431
00:32:03,521 --> 00:32:06,270
Bro, many times the
fights last for months!

432
00:32:06,271 --> 00:32:06,937
Now scram!

433
00:32:07,937 --> 00:32:09,521
It’s Vidwan sir’s test tomorrow...
let’s leave.

434
00:32:26,521 --> 00:32:29,021
Deepu…whether you believe
it or not, I am a Superstar!

435
00:32:29,687 --> 00:32:31,937
Superhero.
- Ya ya…Superhero.

436
00:32:32,312 --> 00:32:33,271
Okay, I believe you.

437
00:32:33,812 --> 00:32:34,521
Thank You.

438
00:32:36,562 --> 00:32:39,396
Other than you, can anyone else
say that you are a Superhero.

439
00:32:41,062 --> 00:32:42,187
Your grandma knows.

440
00:32:45,646 --> 00:32:47,687
How did Grandma die?
Alien attack?

441
00:32:48,062 --> 00:32:50,687
Mmmm…she got pneumonia.

442
00:32:53,437 --> 00:32:57,187
Any other evidence or witness,
who is alive; other than you?

443
00:32:58,021 --> 00:33:01,062
Yes, there is. There is a picture…
I have with my alien friend.

444
00:33:01,521 --> 00:33:02,021
Show me.

445
00:33:02,312 --> 00:33:03,437
This is my childhood picture.

446
00:33:04,271 --> 00:33:05,811
That I know,
but where is the alien?

447
00:33:05,812 --> 00:33:06,687
Right here, next to me.

448
00:33:06,937 --> 00:33:07,896
But that’s an empty space.

449
00:33:08,062 --> 00:33:09,812
Ya ya…alien is not visible in pictures.

450
00:33:12,687 --> 00:33:14,146
You feel you are a superhero, right?

451
00:33:14,312 --> 00:33:16,146
I don’t just feel, I AM !

452
00:33:16,396 --> 00:33:16,937
Okay.

453
00:33:18,062 --> 00:33:18,771
What okay?

454
00:33:20,562 --> 00:33:23,687
Jump all the way till here and
I will believe that you are a Superhero.

455
00:33:24,896 --> 00:33:26,646
Where? Till the spot
you are standing? There?

456
00:33:26,896 --> 00:33:27,437
Yes.

457
00:33:28,062 --> 00:33:30,562
What’s the big deal in that?
I can jump…

458
00:33:47,937 --> 00:33:50,937
Umm…seems a bit too far.
How about till here?

459
00:33:53,312 --> 00:33:55,937
Ohh…will have to practice.

460
00:34:11,937 --> 00:34:14,646
It seems, there’s a different way
for him to come out.

461
00:34:19,562 --> 00:34:20,812
Heyy…the door just opened.

462
00:34:23,812 --> 00:34:26,062
It’s him? Looks too young to be his grandpa!

463
00:34:37,062 --> 00:34:38,937
Let’s go…we will resume tomorrow.

464
00:35:17,396 --> 00:35:18,436
[recording playing] We are seeking God.

465
00:35:18,437 --> 00:35:20,396
Raju, I will be back in a little while.

466
00:35:21,687 --> 00:35:23,562
and don’t leave the shop on him.

467
00:35:24,062 --> 00:35:31,311
- [recording playing] God doesn’t only lives temple.
- God resides within us...

468
00:35:31,312 --> 00:35:32,186
Please get me this stuff.

469
00:35:32,187 --> 00:35:37,271
[recording playing] …we just have to open the eyes
of our mind... and God will appear before us…

470
00:35:50,187 --> 00:35:50,937
Dear God!!

471
00:35:54,062 --> 00:35:57,687
Hey…not this adulterated stuff.
Get the good stuff from inside.

472
00:35:58,437 --> 00:35:59,937
This is a special customer.

473
00:36:01,437 --> 00:36:04,437
Namaste !
- Namaste !

474
00:36:12,812 --> 00:36:14,687
Your total is 430/-.
- HEY!!

475
00:36:16,271 --> 00:36:19,646
What are you saying?!
Who can take money from you?!

476
00:36:20,562 --> 00:36:23,687
All of this is yours only.
Please take it dear God, please.

477
00:36:24,812 --> 00:36:26,562
Hey, how old are you?
- 22.

478
00:36:28,396 --> 00:36:29,062
Go inside.

479
00:36:32,687 --> 00:36:35,937
You do so much for us for free;
how can I charge you money?

480
00:36:38,312 --> 00:36:40,561
If you allow, can I call
the rest of the ‘devotees’ too;

481
00:36:40,562 --> 00:36:42,187
They wanted to see you.

482
00:36:45,937 --> 00:36:49,062
Trees and plants were on earth
long before humans came.

483
00:36:49,937 --> 00:36:51,687
Every tree has a story of their own...
- Oh Grandpa...

484
00:36:51,812 --> 00:36:55,771
We want to listen to the ‘other’ stories!
- Yes yes, i will tell...

485
00:36:57,771 --> 00:36:58,562
Your friends!

486
00:37:10,187 --> 00:37:11,437
So…how have things been?

487
00:37:12,937 --> 00:37:14,312
Ohh. All good.

488
00:37:14,562 --> 00:37:16,646
You must have to do so
much running around, right?

489
00:37:16,771 --> 00:37:17,937
Oh that’s alright.

490
00:37:18,187 --> 00:37:20,187
How can you do all that at this age?

491
00:37:23,187 --> 00:37:25,186
Oh they are asking about
that Superhero thing;

492
00:37:25,187 --> 00:37:26,937
I have told them
that you are a Superhero.

493
00:37:27,187 --> 00:37:29,687
Now whoever has any doubts,
please ask one by one.

494
00:37:31,812 --> 00:37:33,312
Respected Superhero Grandpa!

495
00:37:33,437 --> 00:37:36,687
Whatever you have done for us,
for that I express my gratitude.

496
00:37:36,812 --> 00:37:37,646
Claps!!

497
00:37:41,271 --> 00:37:43,187
Very good!
Now come straight to the question.

498
00:37:44,312 --> 00:37:46,937
Do you also have to go No. 2?

499
00:37:47,146 --> 00:37:48,062
Relevant questions please.

500
00:37:48,271 --> 00:37:50,062
Why do superheroes wear briefs?

501
00:37:50,562 --> 00:37:53,146
Why are the powers lost
if this is told to everyone?

502
00:37:53,312 --> 00:37:54,396
When is the next battle?

503
00:37:54,937 --> 00:37:59,396
Leave these all be, today just tell us
how you became a superhero.

504
00:38:00,687 --> 00:38:04,812
When I was your age...

505
00:38:05,896 --> 00:38:07,521
...I met Musi.

506
00:38:19,562 --> 00:38:24,896
She had come that night to visit Earth,
along with her parents.

507
00:38:26,312 --> 00:38:28,812
They liked the greenery here.

508
00:38:29,437 --> 00:38:31,812
I stepped forward for a closer look.

509
00:38:34,312 --> 00:38:37,312
...and she offered her hand for friendship.

510
00:38:39,687 --> 00:38:41,437
...and then there was light.

511
00:38:46,396 --> 00:38:48,271
I used to play a lot with her.

512
00:38:51,146 --> 00:38:55,437
I used to get those candies for her.
Orange candies.

513
00:38:56,062 --> 00:38:59,146
But I won’t tell anyone.
Neither did she.

514
00:39:02,271 --> 00:39:04,687
One day, her mom-dad saw us.

515
00:39:05,562 --> 00:39:07,437
Then, was there an attack?
- No.

516
00:39:09,312 --> 00:39:13,687
They took her away.
Musi cried a lot as she was leaving.

517
00:39:15,062 --> 00:39:16,187
I cried a lot too.

518
00:39:18,812 --> 00:39:20,271
Then she never came back.

519
00:39:20,812 --> 00:39:23,812
Musi !
Alien, my friend !

520
00:39:24,896 --> 00:39:26,562
That’s it!
- Yes!

521
00:39:27,062 --> 00:39:28,521
Then how did you become a superhero?

522
00:39:28,812 --> 00:39:31,187
C’mon…as she was leaving
Musi left me powers too!

523
00:39:36,146 --> 00:39:40,896
And since then, in her memory,
I maintain cleanliness and keep planting trees.

524
00:39:43,187 --> 00:39:44,562
And when did you fight the first battle?

525
00:39:45,896 --> 00:39:47,562
Aah…never got a chance.

526
00:39:47,771 --> 00:39:50,896
And then there were so many battles
that he never got a chance to count them.

527
00:39:51,396 --> 00:39:51,937
Yeahhh…

528
00:39:53,562 --> 00:39:56,271
Can you show us a stunt
or something superhero like,

529
00:39:56,896 --> 00:39:58,771
so that we could believe
that you are truly a superhero?

530
00:40:10,062 --> 00:40:11,312
Oh! Mom’s here.

531
00:40:13,437 --> 00:40:15,937
You can listen to the stories later;
have juice first.

532
00:40:25,937 --> 00:40:28,062
So…..what did you
think of today’s session?

533
00:40:28,187 --> 00:40:29,812
What was that you were saying?
- What ?

534
00:40:30,312 --> 00:40:31,937
That you didn’t even
get a chance to fight.

535
00:40:32,271 --> 00:40:34,312
Want to get me into trouble?
- Oh…what did I say wrong then?

536
00:40:34,687 --> 00:40:36,687
Since the powers have come,
nothing has happened

537
00:40:37,062 --> 00:40:38,646
No aliens, no fights.

538
00:40:38,896 --> 00:40:41,437
Only when the aliens come,
then can I show the powers, right?

539
00:40:41,562 --> 00:40:42,812
And what if
the aliens don’t come?

540
00:40:43,062 --> 00:40:47,687
Then powers wasted! Hail the lord!
Peace! Bye-bye! Ta-ta!

541
00:40:48,812 --> 00:40:50,771
Then how will you prove?
- What?

542
00:40:51,312 --> 00:40:52,521
That you are a superhero.

543
00:40:56,062 --> 00:40:57,687
What?
- Come here.

544
00:41:00,521 --> 00:41:01,312
With stories!

545
00:41:02,396 --> 00:41:07,062
Till the aliens arrive,
keep spinning stories about your bravery.

546
00:41:07,396 --> 00:41:10,937
and when they do arrive,
then show your bravery for real! Simple!

547
00:41:14,062 --> 00:41:20,021
Oh…avoid this love story.
Me-Musi-Orange candies!

548
00:41:20,396 --> 00:41:26,021
Tell them something which has
fighting, explosions, battles, destruction.

549
00:41:26,562 --> 00:41:27,687
That’s what trends these days.

550
00:41:29,062 --> 00:41:32,187
You want to be a superhero,
but your stories are all cotton candy fluff.

551
00:41:37,396 --> 00:41:41,437
The more humans spread trash,
the sooner the aliens will land.

552
00:41:42,146 --> 00:41:45,271
Their new mission’s name
is Clean Earth Mission.

553
00:41:45,562 --> 00:41:47,937
Wow!
Now aliens will clean up the earth?

554
00:41:48,146 --> 00:41:51,687
No! They will clean us up from the earth.
That’s why they are attacking.

555
00:41:52,062 --> 00:41:53,146
Then, when will the fight be?

556
00:41:53,562 --> 00:41:56,896
Now, that’ll depend on the aliens,
whatever their plan will be.

557
00:41:57,437 --> 00:41:58,771
[in chorus] Hmmm.

558
00:41:59,937 --> 00:42:04,437
All that’s fine, but tell your
Grandpa that till there’re no fights,

559
00:42:04,687 --> 00:42:06,437
at least show us
a costume of the superhero.

560
00:42:12,687 --> 00:42:13,562
Need to get this made.

561
00:42:14,312 --> 00:42:17,936
Oho…this that one right,
which swims in the air and somesaults…

562
00:42:17,937 --> 00:42:20,312
kids watch him on TV.
- Yeah…he’s a superhero.

563
00:42:20,687 --> 00:42:22,437
Will definitely be done
- Hmm.

564
00:42:22,937 --> 00:42:24,896
Give me the measurement of the kid.
- Kid?

565
00:42:25,562 --> 00:42:27,770
Yes; you need this for
the kid’s fancy dress, right?

566
00:42:27,771 --> 00:42:29,187
Oh no-no…
I need this for myself.

567
00:42:31,437 --> 00:42:34,520
Umm…then you need
this brief also made?

568
00:42:34,521 --> 00:42:37,937
Yes! Everything is to be made.
Even the dupatta (cloak) at the back needs to be made.

569
00:42:39,021 --> 00:42:41,646
Sir, with this picture,
can someone else’s picture be joined?

570
00:42:44,146 --> 00:42:45,146
Absolutely Grandpa!

571
00:42:45,312 --> 00:42:48,395
Rekha-Madhuri-Sonali, whoever you wish
to be joined with, we’ll get it joined!

572
00:42:48,396 --> 00:42:50,061
No, no.
- More real than real itself!

573
00:42:50,062 --> 00:42:54,062
Umm…err..the one which
flies in from other planets…

574
00:42:54,187 --> 00:42:55,771
Alien ?
- Alien.

575
00:42:56,312 --> 00:43:01,062
Can we have it, in my picture,
standing next to me? like this.

576
00:43:01,312 --> 00:43:04,687
Oh Grandpa!! We can even
have it dance next to you!

577
00:43:04,812 --> 00:43:08,521
It will look like the aliens had come to the Earth
to just have their picture taken with you.

578
00:43:09,312 --> 00:43:13,312
Grandpa…should I put an Indian alien
or a Chinese or an American one?

579
00:43:13,521 --> 00:43:15,812
Oh but aliens are from out of Earth, right?

580
00:43:16,687 --> 00:43:21,812
But Grandpa, different types of aliens come
to India and different to America.

581
00:43:23,021 --> 00:43:24,812
Then make it native, Indian.

582
00:43:25,062 --> 00:43:26,271
Yes, yes !
- Thank you.

583
00:43:28,396 --> 00:43:32,562
Bro, what a beating that was... super fun.
They were acting smart...

584
00:43:35,812 --> 00:43:39,562
Umm…bathroom?
- Yes, that way but the flush doesn’t work.

585
00:43:42,312 --> 00:43:44,187
See, I am definitely a superhero.
- Hmmm.

586
00:43:44,562 --> 00:43:47,436
But looking at their enthusiasm,
I am a bit nervous.

587
00:43:47,437 --> 00:43:48,311
If the alien doesn’t show up…

588
00:43:48,312 --> 00:43:51,187
Till then Dad will get transferred.
Why are you getting tense?

589
00:43:53,771 --> 00:43:56,646
Look Grandpa, you just keep
passing the time like this…

590
00:43:57,437 --> 00:44:01,187
…you have got your fans and
my reputation will be secured too.

591
00:44:01,437 --> 00:44:04,021
Grandpa, I have marketed you a lot!

592
00:44:04,771 --> 00:44:07,687
Please don’t mess it up.
- [Sigh]

593
00:44:14,437 --> 00:44:15,687
Come, let’s take you around a bit.

594
00:44:16,521 --> 00:44:18,771
Where?
- Just come!

595
00:44:48,021 --> 00:44:51,312
You must fly even higher, right?
This should be nothing for you!

596
00:45:04,312 --> 00:45:05,562
Yo! Hello!

597
00:45:06,271 --> 00:45:09,146
Raju said that you gave stuff from
the shop for free to someone.

598
00:45:09,437 --> 00:45:11,687
Sorry dad.
I can’t tell you a lot.

599
00:45:11,937 --> 00:45:13,187
But he’s a very useful guy.

600
00:45:13,312 --> 00:45:15,061
Let me know if someone’s
causing you any trouble.

601
00:45:15,062 --> 00:45:16,146
Will get them set!

602
00:45:16,396 --> 00:45:18,187
Right now son,
I am troubled by you!

603
00:45:19,812 --> 00:45:22,062
Stop ! Where are you going ?
Stop !

604
00:45:37,396 --> 00:45:38,312
Poor guy…

605
00:45:38,687 --> 00:45:40,937
Now how am I to explain
what’s happening outside.

606
00:45:42,062 --> 00:45:44,895
So… if we wanted to be
superheroes like you,

607
00:45:44,896 --> 00:45:45,937
then what should we do?

608
00:45:46,062 --> 00:45:47,021
That I will tell you.

609
00:45:47,687 --> 00:45:48,437
Pay attention…

610
00:45:48,812 --> 00:45:51,646
When the aliens come,
woo their daughter and say-

611
00:45:52,271 --> 00:45:57,812
‘Hey Senorita! I don’t want love…I want power!’

612
00:45:58,562 --> 00:46:00,937
Hey hey hey…
wanna get killed or what?

613
00:46:01,937 --> 00:46:03,771
You can’t become superheroes like that.

614
00:46:03,937 --> 00:46:05,437
If you want to be a superhero...

615
00:46:05,687 --> 00:46:09,437
...then exercise, build your body, eat well,

616
00:46:09,562 --> 00:46:10,562
grow trees and plants,

617
00:46:11,062 --> 00:46:13,646
breathe deep, serve your parents...

618
00:46:13,937 --> 00:46:18,562
Maintain cleanliness,
help everyone, be useful to all...

619
00:46:20,312 --> 00:46:22,312
that’s how to become a superhero.
Got it?

620
00:46:23,562 --> 00:46:27,562
Exposing is not my job
but my habit.

621
00:46:27,937 --> 00:46:30,646
Till he doesn’t reach the root of it,

622
00:46:30,812 --> 00:46:34,062
he keeps at it-
Exposé King, Kannu!

623
00:46:34,896 --> 00:46:38,437
Clean, Clear and Candid.

624
00:46:38,937 --> 00:46:39,437
Dad !

625
00:46:39,937 --> 00:46:41,146
Yes.
- Tell me something.

626
00:46:41,437 --> 00:46:41,937
Yes.

627
00:46:42,646 --> 00:46:43,937
How does one do an exposé?

628
00:46:45,146 --> 00:46:46,312
Interesting question.

629
00:46:48,312 --> 00:46:53,312
The person you are suspicious of;
first listen to them fully.

630
00:46:54,062 --> 00:46:58,937
Then whatever seems off to you,
investigate them one by one.

631
00:46:59,812 --> 00:47:05,062
Then, question after question;
question after question- keep asking.

632
00:47:05,771 --> 00:47:07,562
They will get trapped on their own.

633
00:47:12,062 --> 00:47:14,521
Tell us something Grandpa…
- Yes?

634
00:47:14,646 --> 00:47:16,896
When the aliens come,
then how would we know?

635
00:47:19,146 --> 00:47:23,312
One can see a blue light
coming down from the sky.

636
00:47:24,312 --> 00:47:25,812
Amazing!
Which movie is this from. ?

637
00:47:26,062 --> 00:47:28,396
Oh brother!
It will come; hasn’t come yet

638
00:47:28,562 --> 00:47:30,312
[all laugh]

639
00:47:31,312 --> 00:47:33,062
Make one spicy…
extra chilli!

640
00:47:40,646 --> 00:47:41,312
How many times?

641
00:47:42,062 --> 00:47:43,937
Fourth.
- Fifth.

642
00:47:46,562 --> 00:47:48,687
Very good! Why not have
some more junk food.

643
00:47:49,312 --> 00:47:50,937
You have no control over your taste buds.

644
00:47:51,437 --> 00:47:52,937
This is not the age for
indulging in junk food.

645
00:47:54,146 --> 00:47:54,687
What happened?

646
00:47:58,437 --> 00:47:59,187
Sixth time.

647
00:48:01,187 --> 00:48:02,896
Chanakya.
- Absent!

648
00:48:04,437 --> 00:48:05,937
Saksham.
- Absent!

649
00:48:06,521 --> 00:48:07,896
Sachin.
- Absent!

650
00:48:08,312 --> 00:48:09,646
Sunil.
- Absent!

651
00:48:10,062 --> 00:48:12,937
Absent! Absent !
Absent!

652
00:48:18,062 --> 00:48:19,896
Doctor! No needle please…

653
00:48:20,437 --> 00:48:22,062
aren’t there any pills
instead of this?

654
00:48:23,396 --> 00:48:25,270
I’ll die sir…
am not used to this…

655
00:48:25,271 --> 00:48:27,020
You’ll have instant relief…
…what instant relief!?

656
00:48:27,021 --> 00:48:28,811
My life will fly out!
Doctor…sir sir..please

657
00:48:28,812 --> 00:48:30,020
Dad…don’t create
a scene here please!

658
00:48:30,021 --> 00:48:30,686
Nothing will happen to you!

659
00:48:30,687 --> 00:48:31,562
I am not creating a scene.

660
00:48:31,812 --> 00:48:33,895
When I don’t want a needle then
why are you all forcing me.

661
00:48:33,896 --> 00:48:34,646
Please hold him down.

662
00:48:36,771 --> 00:48:38,686
You are a superhero Grandpa…
c’mon take it!

663
00:48:38,687 --> 00:48:40,061
Oh I am not a superhero!

664
00:48:40,062 --> 00:48:40,686
Hold him down!

665
00:48:40,687 --> 00:48:45,020
- No no no….
- I don’t want a needle
then why are you all forcing me

666
00:48:45,021 --> 00:48:47,646
Nothing will happen to you.
- What nothing will happen!!!!

667
00:48:49,021 --> 00:48:50,562
What a patient!
- AAARGGHHHH!!!

668
00:48:57,896 --> 00:48:59,187
Was it you who
was shouting inside?

669
00:49:09,771 --> 00:49:12,812
Both of them are making fools
out of us. There’s no superhero.

670
00:49:12,937 --> 00:49:16,312
Listen bro, this is a
‘Gangadhar is Shaktimaan’ situation.

671
00:49:16,646 --> 00:49:18,062
They all are just like this.

672
00:49:18,312 --> 00:49:20,812
But when the aliens come,
then their avatar will change-

673
00:49:21,062 --> 00:49:23,812
And it will be the awesome Superhero one!

674
00:49:25,021 --> 00:49:27,812
Let’s see…when will this
‘awesome Superhero’ be visible!

675
00:49:37,687 --> 00:49:38,687
Tell me one thing...

676
00:49:39,021 --> 00:49:40,562
You get hurt by an injection;

677
00:49:40,687 --> 00:49:42,936
You are scared of heights,
scared of the dark…

678
00:49:42,937 --> 00:49:45,562
I am not scared of the dark.
I can’t see in the dark

679
00:49:45,896 --> 00:49:47,020
I am afraid of falling.

680
00:49:47,021 --> 00:49:48,686
And then you claim
that you are a superhero.

681
00:49:48,687 --> 00:49:50,020
When the aliens come...

682
00:49:50,021 --> 00:49:50,811
...then I will show you what
kind of a superhero I am!

683
00:49:50,812 --> 00:49:52,270
And the aliens are
never going to come.

684
00:49:52,271 --> 00:49:52,937
They WILL...

685
00:49:54,521 --> 00:49:55,937
My heart says that they will come.

686
00:49:57,271 --> 00:49:59,771
They are aliens…
not ‘Karan Arjun’ that they will come.

687
00:50:00,021 --> 00:50:03,186
O Dear Lord….either you
send those aliens down here

688
00:50:03,187 --> 00:50:04,771
or call me up to you!

689
00:50:06,521 --> 00:50:07,687
Why don’t they believe it?

690
00:50:08,812 --> 00:50:11,312
Sorry God…for bothering
you this late in the night.

691
00:50:12,396 --> 00:50:14,937
Please send a couple of aliens.
Grandpa is getting old.

692
00:50:15,312 --> 00:50:18,271
Poor guy is a superhero and
still letting himself be disrespected.

693
00:50:19,937 --> 00:50:21,562
Now YOU must do something.
Please.

694
00:50:22,521 --> 00:50:23,937
I have stolen this from dad.

695
00:50:24,896 --> 00:50:26,937
Don’t worry,
I will return it once I start earning.

696
00:50:27,896 --> 00:50:29,062
Good Night.
Take care.

697
00:51:11,937 --> 00:51:13,396
May I help you with something?

698
00:51:15,146 --> 00:51:16,812
No dear, it’s not that heavy.

699
00:51:17,062 --> 00:51:18,937
In that case,
let me help a little bit then.

700
00:51:21,521 --> 00:51:23,312
What will you do with these plants?

701
00:51:23,937 --> 00:51:26,812
These…
Oh I keep planting these.

702
00:51:27,187 --> 00:51:29,062
After all, plants are our superpower!

703
00:51:30,187 --> 00:51:31,771
By the way,
which school do you study in?

704
00:51:32,187 --> 00:51:33,937
In Adarsh Vidyalay Mandir.

705
00:51:34,562 --> 00:51:38,187
Oh! Our Deepu also studies there!

706
00:51:38,812 --> 00:51:40,812
You are Deepu’s Grandpa?
- Yes.

707
00:51:41,312 --> 00:51:44,896
That means you are the superhero?
I have heard your stories.

708
00:51:45,187 --> 00:51:45,812
Really ?

709
00:51:48,187 --> 00:51:50,271
Can I get superpowers too?

710
00:51:50,812 --> 00:51:52,562
What will YOU do with superpowers?

711
00:51:53,312 --> 00:51:56,021
You see, I want to stand
on my feet by myself;

712
00:51:56,312 --> 00:51:57,937
that too without any support.

713
00:52:07,396 --> 00:52:09,687
If there’s no trash,
then how will the aliens arrive?

714
00:52:10,187 --> 00:52:13,062
and only when the aliens arrive,
will we know about the superhero.

715
00:52:32,271 --> 00:52:34,062
The first time,
mom-dad had landed right here.

716
00:52:36,062 --> 00:52:37,646
That’s why the large crater.

717
00:52:38,312 --> 00:52:41,396
Now see, it’s full of water;
such a beautiful lake.

718
00:52:41,521 --> 00:52:42,146
Yes...

719
00:52:45,187 --> 00:52:46,062
Are you new here?

720
00:52:46,687 --> 00:52:49,812
Have never seen you before.
- Yes. Just landed.

721
00:52:50,146 --> 00:52:51,187
Umm…from where?

722
00:52:52,937 --> 00:52:54,396
You see the moon there…

723
00:52:56,437 --> 00:52:58,561
…which is left from the moon,
after 5 lakh kilometers a right...

724
00:52:58,562 --> 00:53:01,146
and then after two planets left again.
From there.

725
00:53:02,271 --> 00:53:03,187
Your identity?

726
00:53:04,896 --> 00:53:07,770
We can fly,
can live for years without eating,

727
00:53:07,771 --> 00:53:09,145
can speak in any language…

728
00:53:09,146 --> 00:53:11,021
He just wants to
know who you are.

729
00:53:11,771 --> 00:53:13,521
Ohh sorry! We are…

730
00:53:16,646 --> 00:53:18,187
…You won’t tell anyone,
will you?

731
00:53:19,521 --> 00:53:21,896
We are aliens.
We have come from another planet.

732
00:53:22,437 --> 00:53:24,062
Huh?
- Don’t tell anyone.

733
00:53:26,562 --> 00:53:27,896
Are you here for
someone’s wedding?

734
00:53:28,021 --> 00:53:28,437
- No.

735
00:53:29,396 --> 00:53:31,812
There’s going to be an attack on Earth.
We are here in that regard…

736
00:53:33,062 --> 00:53:36,937
Here, there are trees, hills,
water, clouds, aquatic life…

737
00:53:52,187 --> 00:53:53,437
Pure khadi!

738
00:53:54,812 --> 00:53:58,187
The tailor said that just a couple
of washes and it will be perfect!

739
00:53:59,437 --> 00:54:02,646
And a few push ups,
tummy goes and chest comes out!

740
00:54:05,146 --> 00:54:06,437
Very Good !
- Thank You.

741
00:54:06,646 --> 00:54:09,812
Do one thing;
hang this costume on the terrace.

742
00:54:10,396 --> 00:54:12,062
The aliens will never come to earth then.

743
00:54:12,812 --> 00:54:15,436
And which superhero
has a half-sleeve costume?!

744
00:54:15,437 --> 00:54:17,686
Oh… the tailor ran out of cloth
so he made it half-sleeved.

745
00:54:17,687 --> 00:54:18,521
and by the way…

746
00:54:22,687 --> 00:54:24,062
This is the alien?
- Yes!

747
00:54:24,271 --> 00:54:27,687
This is Jaadu!!
The whole world has watched the film!

748
00:54:28,187 --> 00:54:30,896
Oh! I didn’t see this!

749
00:54:32,312 --> 00:54:34,187
What happened?
Why are you shouting?

750
00:54:34,937 --> 00:54:36,646
He thinks of himself as a superhero.

751
00:54:36,771 --> 00:54:37,895
[sneakily] Powers will be lost.
- What ?

752
00:54:37,896 --> 00:54:39,396
He thinks he is a superhero.

753
00:54:40,437 --> 00:54:41,562
Yes.
He is a superhero.

754
00:54:44,062 --> 00:54:45,812
That too the greatest superhero!

755
00:54:46,687 --> 00:54:49,187
Is it?
Which battle did he fight?

756
00:54:49,687 --> 00:54:50,812
The battles of Life.

757
00:54:51,771 --> 00:54:54,562
When he was very young,
my grandpa passed away.

758
00:54:55,062 --> 00:54:57,937
Along with his mother,
he took responsibility for the whole household.

759
00:54:58,687 --> 00:55:00,312
He would help his mother at the shop.

760
00:55:00,771 --> 00:55:04,271
Went to school barefeet.
He began to earn while still studying.

761
00:55:04,771 --> 00:55:07,687
Got his mother treated
with his own hard work.

762
00:55:07,937 --> 00:55:10,062
Built a house.
Got his sisters married.

763
00:55:10,687 --> 00:55:13,687
He is such a simple man that
he has not even killed an ant till date.

764
00:55:15,396 --> 00:55:18,521
Son, all of these only
a superhero can accomplish.

765
00:55:22,771 --> 00:55:23,687
Love you dad!

766
00:55:45,687 --> 00:55:48,187
That’s my grandpa.
He used to be a boxer.

767
00:56:04,437 --> 00:56:07,687
Did you tell him about Deepu’s grandpa?

768
00:56:08,437 --> 00:56:11,562
Should I?
What if his powers are lost?

769
00:56:12,437 --> 00:56:13,396
It’s all lies.

770
00:56:23,437 --> 00:56:25,896
Grandpa…
- Say Grand Father!

771
00:56:26,312 --> 00:56:29,771
Grandfather,
do you think superheroes exist?

772
00:56:30,812 --> 00:56:32,396
Don’t you see me?!

773
00:56:32,812 --> 00:56:35,520
Can you fly?
Have you fought battles?

774
00:56:35,521 --> 00:56:36,896
Even the crow flies.

775
00:56:37,646 --> 00:56:40,062
And as of battles,
I have fought many.

776
00:56:41,312 --> 00:56:46,312
There’s a boy in our class.
He says, his grandpa is a superhero!

777
00:56:48,021 --> 00:56:49,062
Power’s gone!

778
00:57:02,396 --> 00:57:03,146
So…tell me now.

779
00:57:03,562 --> 00:57:06,437
Who’s that in your class who plays a hero?
- Deepu’s grandpa.

780
00:57:06,687 --> 00:57:11,187
He says his grandpa can fly,
pick up trains.

781
00:57:11,562 --> 00:57:13,562
Did he show you any of this?
- No.

782
00:57:14,687 --> 00:57:16,437
Get him to box with me once.

783
00:57:17,646 --> 00:57:20,812
Then he will never say
that he is a superpower.

784
00:57:26,312 --> 00:57:27,812
Grandpa doesn’t fight with humans.

785
00:57:28,062 --> 00:57:30,436
What if they get hurt badly?
It will be a mess.

786
00:57:30,437 --> 00:57:33,687
He’s a boxing champion dude.
He’s beaten up many people.

787
00:57:35,062 --> 00:57:36,771
He’s boxed at the national level.

788
00:57:37,062 --> 00:57:39,312
Bro…he’s beaten up aliens.

789
00:57:40,271 --> 00:57:43,062
He’s at the Universal level.
What are you saying!

790
00:57:52,937 --> 00:57:54,312
You can eat…don’t worry.

791
00:57:58,812 --> 00:57:59,812
Eat, eat!

792
00:58:01,437 --> 00:58:05,561
Grandpa…our costume and
picture ideas don’t seem to be working.

793
00:58:05,562 --> 00:58:06,936
So, let’s let them go.

794
00:58:06,937 --> 00:58:09,312
Yeah…I didn’t like them either.
We would have been caught.

795
00:58:09,562 --> 00:58:11,396
That’s why I am not going
to pay full price for them either.

796
00:58:14,021 --> 00:58:17,312
Grandpa, I have a great idea!
- Tell me.

797
00:58:17,562 --> 00:58:20,937
You will have to fight a little with
Saksham’s grandfather, as in boxing.

798
00:58:21,562 --> 00:58:24,437
Once you defeat him
we will have nothing to worry about.

799
00:58:24,812 --> 00:58:27,936
Whether aliens come or not,
you don’t have to worry.

800
00:58:27,937 --> 00:58:30,687
I’ll prove that you are a superhero
and that’s that.

801
00:58:31,187 --> 00:58:32,771
I think you will fight just fine.

802
00:58:33,187 --> 00:58:35,436
We have fixed the match
with Kartar Singh on Sunday.

803
00:58:35,437 --> 00:58:37,311
So do your exercises.
- Yo ! That Kartar...

804
00:58:37,312 --> 00:58:40,187
haven’t you seen how huge his hands are.
Wanna get me killed?!

805
00:58:40,437 --> 00:58:42,021
Seems like you have
put a bounty on my head!

806
00:58:47,396 --> 00:58:50,562
Keep your confidence up.
Start exercising from tomorrow morning.

807
00:58:51,521 --> 00:58:55,812
Look here Grandpa, you have caused this mess
and now you only will have to sort this out.

808
00:58:58,312 --> 00:59:01,937
Now stop having this Laddu.
Have something healthy instead.

809
00:59:02,646 --> 00:59:03,562
Gobbling laddus!

810
00:59:12,562 --> 00:59:14,396
Son, put my name down.

811
00:59:17,187 --> 00:59:18,937
I wanna build my body.

812
00:59:19,396 --> 00:59:21,062
Why do you want to build
your body Grandpa?

813
00:59:21,771 --> 00:59:23,146
Have to fight a battle.

814
00:59:27,812 --> 00:59:31,271
Hey…how long will it take
to get strength like him?

815
00:59:46,521 --> 00:59:49,687
Aren’t you the kids’ superstar Grandpa?
- Yes.

816
00:59:51,687 --> 00:59:53,520
You must have heard of
the boxing match then.

817
00:59:53,521 --> 00:59:55,771
Yes yes…that friendly match
that the kids have organized.

818
00:59:57,437 --> 01:00:01,562
Well, it’s friendly to speak of
but we will play it seriously.

819
01:00:03,312 --> 01:00:05,396
Seriously; okay.

820
01:00:06,896 --> 01:00:09,021
C’mon! Do it!
You can do it!

821
01:00:09,562 --> 01:00:10,937
The kids have
high expectations from you.

822
01:00:23,187 --> 01:00:24,812
Wow! Uprooted it!!!

823
01:00:25,187 --> 01:00:26,771
Look bro,
that’s how the Earth people fight!

824
01:00:29,687 --> 01:00:30,520
Hello sister!

825
01:00:30,521 --> 01:00:31,562
Did you find the superhero?

826
01:00:31,771 --> 01:00:33,187
No sister.
We haven’t been able to track him.

827
01:00:33,562 --> 01:00:35,812
So we had come to watch a Sunny Deol film.

828
01:00:36,312 --> 01:00:38,645
What action!
- C’mon hero!! Hit the villain!

829
01:00:38,646 --> 01:00:39,811
Have you gone nuts!

830
01:00:39,812 --> 01:00:43,312
The force has attacked!
They might leave any minute!

831
01:00:46,562 --> 01:00:48,062
Aliens won’t come for
just this much trash.

832
01:00:48,187 --> 01:00:50,271
Where’s the superhero
for the aliens to come!

833
01:01:10,687 --> 01:01:12,812
Son…pass me my teeth please.

834
01:01:14,146 --> 01:01:18,021
Here, everyone's grandpas are boxing and
you can’t even pick up your own teeth!

835
01:01:22,271 --> 01:01:23,811
Bro, even my grandpa wants to fight.

836
01:01:23,812 --> 01:01:27,020
Hey…he’s too old!
Will end up losing his teeth.

837
01:01:27,021 --> 01:01:28,687
There’s nothing to
worry about the teeth.

838
01:01:29,021 --> 01:01:30,896
They are already fake.
We can get new ones.

839
01:01:35,062 --> 01:01:36,562
Put my name down too.

840
01:01:36,771 --> 01:01:39,437
What’s more important is fighting itself.
Not win or loss.

841
01:01:52,021 --> 01:01:54,896
Poor chap…
really wanted to fight a boxing match.

842
01:01:55,562 --> 01:01:57,896
If he could have fought,
he’d have left with respect.

843
01:02:02,062 --> 01:02:05,312
Bro, let's put our names down,
else the kids won’t let us live in peace.

844
01:02:06,521 --> 01:02:07,187
You’re right!

845
01:02:32,687 --> 01:02:34,646
What grandpa…
you're lifting such puny weights!

846
01:02:35,146 --> 01:02:37,812
Lift some heavy weights…
Be a MAN!!

847
01:02:38,021 --> 01:02:38,521
Yes.

848
01:02:39,021 --> 01:02:40,396
Okay…just a minute!

849
01:02:41,812 --> 01:02:43,312
Now give it your all!

850
01:02:47,771 --> 01:02:50,646
Heyy….anyone!!
Help!!

851
01:02:55,312 --> 01:03:01,271
Here is a list of 12 people who are
participating in the boxing championship.

852
01:03:01,937 --> 01:03:06,562
If the championship happens in the school,
then all the kids will see it.

853
01:03:06,771 --> 01:03:10,145
And they will all feel
very proud that even at this age,

854
01:03:10,146 --> 01:03:12,937
their grandfathers have
the spirit in them to fight.

855
01:03:13,187 --> 01:03:15,562
Nice!
Nice initiative!

856
01:03:16,437 --> 01:03:17,562
There’s a doubt sir.

857
01:03:18,521 --> 01:03:21,687
Bearing our ages in mind,
if anyone gets hurt,

858
01:03:21,896 --> 01:03:25,561
then it might affect the kids adversely,
even the school.

859
01:03:25,562 --> 01:03:28,312
You are so powerful;
then what are YOU worried about?!

860
01:03:28,896 --> 01:03:31,312
I was just saying it for everyone.

861
01:03:31,771 --> 01:03:33,396
Now it’s a matter of our honour.

862
01:03:33,562 --> 01:03:35,896
Either we fight or we die!

863
01:03:36,396 --> 01:03:39,687
We won’t die,
we will be martyred!

864
01:03:40,021 --> 01:03:40,936
We will pass on with honour.

865
01:03:40,937 --> 01:03:43,771
Err…why don’t we race instead sir?

866
01:03:44,812 --> 01:03:46,437
Sporting spirit can still be reflected in that.

867
01:03:46,771 --> 01:03:49,687
Fighting will only showcase violence.
- EXCUSE ME !

868
01:03:49,812 --> 01:03:53,812
Boxing is a sport;
it is not fighting. Mind It!

869
01:03:54,271 --> 01:03:58,187
Sir…he’s right.
Let’s have a race.

870
01:04:07,812 --> 01:04:10,396
Deepu’s grandpa will not let you win.

871
01:04:11,646 --> 01:04:14,937
It is not about win or loss;
it is about fighting

872
01:04:17,437 --> 01:04:20,062
Yeah yeah…have your fun;
make a fool of me.

873
01:04:22,437 --> 01:04:23,812
Careful…careful…

874
01:04:26,687 --> 01:04:28,562
Now, you must do what I tell you.

875
01:04:29,312 --> 01:04:31,146
You will have to try to finish first.

876
01:04:31,312 --> 01:04:33,937
But if you can’t then it doesn’t matter;
just finish last.

877
01:04:34,521 --> 01:04:36,937
Not even second;
either first or last.

878
01:04:37,271 --> 01:04:39,812
Why?!
- All’s good if you finish first.

879
01:04:40,062 --> 01:04:43,146
But if you finish last then I will tell everyone
that you did it for the sake of everyone else.

880
01:04:44,187 --> 01:04:46,061
Got it?
Either first or…?

881
01:04:46,062 --> 01:04:46,562
Last.

882
01:04:46,937 --> 01:04:48,187
Bravo!
Go!

883
01:04:55,562 --> 01:04:56,437
Hello... Hello...

884
01:04:56,562 --> 01:04:57,812
Good Morning Children!

885
01:04:58,312 --> 01:05:00,562
You are all welcome
to this exciting race!

886
01:05:01,396 --> 01:05:04,396
You see, in this race first
or last are not that important.

887
01:05:04,812 --> 01:05:06,021
Running is what is important.

888
01:05:06,896 --> 01:05:08,811
Organization of such an event….
[announcement fades]

889
01:05:08,812 --> 01:05:11,937
Grandpa should have raced
with people of his level.

890
01:05:12,312 --> 01:05:14,062
A superhero racing with them?!

891
01:05:15,062 --> 01:05:18,146
If only the aliens had arrived on time,
we wouldn’t have to witness all of this.

892
01:05:18,521 --> 01:05:22,187
[announcement] Whoever participates today,
is already a winner for us.

893
01:05:22,896 --> 01:05:28,187
So let’s find out then,
who becomes today’s- Super Grandpa!

894
01:05:32,812 --> 01:05:38,187
So ready…Get…Set…and…

895
01:05:40,687 --> 01:05:41,562
C’mon sir…

896
01:05:41,687 --> 01:05:42,812
Grandfather seems to
be really pumped up!

897
01:05:48,187 --> 01:05:50,437
Why do Earth people
drive in slow motion?

898
01:05:51,396 --> 01:05:53,021
This is their actual speed.

899
01:05:53,396 --> 01:05:56,437
Oh…so slow!

900
01:06:01,687 --> 01:06:03,437
Sister’s call!

901
01:06:05,646 --> 01:06:07,687
Hello Sister!
- Where have you reached?

902
01:06:08,521 --> 01:06:10,020
Sister, we are on a bus;
on our way.

903
01:06:10,021 --> 01:06:12,187
On a bus?!
Where’s your spaceship?

904
01:06:12,437 --> 01:06:15,812
Err…we had parked in the wrong place
so it got towed.

905
01:06:16,437 --> 01:06:17,812
Super…you can’t even
take care of a spaceship?!

906
01:06:19,062 --> 01:06:22,062
Sister we don’t have the permissions.
They are asking for some PAN of Aadhaar.

907
01:06:22,187 --> 01:06:23,062
Aadhaar of PAN.

908
01:06:23,521 --> 01:06:25,187
They are asking for an Aadhaar of PAN.

909
01:06:25,896 --> 01:06:28,436
There’s been an overthrow
of the regime here. Look up!!

910
01:06:28,437 --> 01:06:30,312
What?!
- The enemy forces have left.

911
01:06:35,687 --> 01:06:36,687
Hey…what are you doing?

912
01:06:37,187 --> 01:06:38,562
You will die yourself
and get others killed too!

913
01:06:38,937 --> 01:06:40,646
Sorry…sorry…sorry.

914
01:06:41,521 --> 01:06:43,395
Moron, you shouldn’t
spit on the Earth!

915
01:06:43,396 --> 01:06:44,062
Shameless!

916
01:06:51,812 --> 01:06:53,437
Could you please drive
a little faster, brother?

917
01:06:59,271 --> 01:07:00,271
Here…you drive!

918
01:07:01,062 --> 01:07:04,896
I drove off in my car,

919
01:07:15,312 --> 01:07:20,061
Ready…get…set…
and…[whistle!]

920
01:07:20,062 --> 01:07:21,562
C’mon Grandpa run!

921
01:07:24,187 --> 01:07:27,270
I drove off in my car,

922
01:07:27,271 --> 01:07:30,311
On the way, not too far,

923
01:07:30,312 --> 01:07:34,312
Sachin’s grandfather is walking
at the last position….er…running!

924
01:07:34,687 --> 01:07:36,146
My honour’s all spoiled.

925
01:07:37,562 --> 01:07:40,436
I left my heart behind at that spot.

926
01:07:40,437 --> 01:07:42,687
Kartar sir is in the lead!

927
01:07:53,562 --> 01:07:54,187
Surprise !!

928
01:07:54,562 --> 01:07:58,062
Sachin’s grandfather has left the rest
of the grandfathers behind and is in the lead!

929
01:07:58,187 --> 01:07:58,687
Bravo !!

930
01:07:59,312 --> 01:08:00,686
Hey…what are you doing lying down!

931
01:08:00,687 --> 01:08:01,812
C’mon...
get up Grandfather!

932
01:08:04,396 --> 01:08:06,187
You were saying that
your Grandpa is a national level sportsman.

933
01:08:07,312 --> 01:08:08,521
That’s what he had said.

934
01:08:09,562 --> 01:08:11,562
All grandpas have made
up their own stories.

935
01:08:12,437 --> 01:08:14,436
Kartar Singh sir is up and running…

936
01:08:14,437 --> 01:08:15,686
C’mon, run, run!!

937
01:08:15,687 --> 01:08:17,271
I woke up, and ran off.

938
01:08:17,562 --> 01:08:19,437
Almost reaching the finishing line…

939
01:08:20,062 --> 01:08:22,686
I leaped across every barrier,

940
01:08:22,687 --> 01:08:24,311
…and he wins!!

941
01:08:24,312 --> 01:08:27,061
At the second place is
Sachin’s grandfather.

942
01:08:27,062 --> 01:08:29,770
I left my heart behind at that spot

943
01:08:29,771 --> 01:08:32,437
Our Super Grandpa for
the day is Kartar Singh sir!

944
01:08:40,062 --> 01:08:41,687
They won because of you.

945
01:08:43,021 --> 01:08:46,437
And I feel that
you too should get a prize.

946
01:08:49,271 --> 01:08:50,562
You are a winner too!

947
01:08:57,937 --> 01:09:02,687
After zero, we have
a new invention in our class, Superzero!

948
01:09:06,812 --> 01:09:13,687
Farter, Farter, who’s a Farter?
- Deepu’s Grandfather, Deepu’s Grandfather!

949
01:09:42,562 --> 01:09:43,812
There is no superhero afterall.

950
01:09:44,062 --> 01:09:45,562
Now we will have to make do
watching this fight only.

951
01:09:50,271 --> 01:09:51,271
You don’t worry, okay.

952
01:09:51,812 --> 01:09:53,271
Once Grandpa gets powers...

953
01:09:53,896 --> 01:09:57,021
...then along with the aliens,
we will rough them up too.

954
01:09:58,437 --> 01:09:59,562
I have been lying.

955
01:10:00,562 --> 01:10:04,562
There’s no superhero.
Grandpa’s a Superzero only.

956
01:10:06,021 --> 01:10:09,396
When I joined newly,
I didn’t know how to make friends.

957
01:10:10,937 --> 01:10:12,062
That’s why I lied.

958
01:10:14,437 --> 01:10:15,271
Sorry.

959
01:10:57,312 --> 01:10:58,645
Deepu,
remember…

960
01:10:58,646 --> 01:11:00,521
strong friendships are built
only when you tell the truth.

961
01:11:05,896 --> 01:11:07,187
We shouldn’t write on walls.

962
01:11:07,396 --> 01:11:09,312
If we tell everyone,
then powers are lost, right...

963
01:11:11,312 --> 01:11:12,271
But where’s the power, eh?

964
01:11:13,396 --> 01:11:14,687
Then we should definitely write!

965
01:11:14,896 --> 01:11:16,312
There should be complete insult.
Write!

966
01:11:21,437 --> 01:11:24,396
Deepu’s …Grandpa…Super…

967
01:11:24,937 --> 01:11:25,812
Hero!!

968
01:11:27,187 --> 01:11:28,646
Who’s Grandpa is a superhero?

969
01:11:28,771 --> 01:11:30,312
Deepu’s Grandpa.
At least, that's what he says!

970
01:11:32,687 --> 01:11:33,896
Alright, let’s check and confirm.

971
01:11:34,062 --> 01:11:34,937
Are you an alien?

972
01:11:35,312 --> 01:11:36,146
How did you know?

973
01:11:37,062 --> 01:11:40,687
Now we know everything!
Who’s a superhero; and who’s an alien!!

974
01:11:43,812 --> 01:11:44,937
Hey, we really are aliens!

975
01:11:45,187 --> 01:11:46,437
Are you really an alien?
- YES!

976
01:11:46,646 --> 01:11:47,771
Alright then,
show us how you fly.

977
01:11:49,021 --> 01:11:50,437
We shouldn’t waste time now.
- Yes.

978
01:11:58,687 --> 01:11:59,271
Hey! Shut up!

979
01:12:00,812 --> 01:12:01,771
Believe us now?

980
01:12:02,437 --> 01:12:03,562
What’s your next plan?

981
01:12:03,937 --> 01:12:05,312
There’s going to be
an attack on Earth

982
01:12:06,396 --> 01:12:07,812
Please, please get me down!

983
01:12:08,021 --> 01:12:09,562
Mom is calling me.
I have to do my homework.

984
01:12:09,812 --> 01:12:11,312
MOM!! MOM!!!

985
01:12:16,646 --> 01:12:17,937
Him!
That’s him!!

986
01:12:19,937 --> 01:12:21,896
And who’s that next to him?

987
01:12:22,021 --> 01:12:22,812
This is an alien.

988
01:12:23,146 --> 01:12:25,646
He had ordered a picture with him.
Still hasn’t paid.

989
01:12:26,687 --> 01:12:29,021
This is an alien?!
Are aliens like this?!

990
01:12:30,021 --> 01:12:31,271
Have a little decency bro!

991
01:12:31,437 --> 01:12:33,186
At least have some respect
for people from other planets.

992
01:12:33,187 --> 01:12:35,646
Later you will be whining
about aliens attacking!!

993
01:12:36,146 --> 01:12:37,187
You wanna attack him?

994
01:12:37,812 --> 01:12:40,187
Oh no! Let’s go there first.
That’s more important. C’mon !

995
01:12:41,146 --> 01:12:42,271
Want to attack just anywhere?!

996
01:12:49,312 --> 01:12:51,437
Call Grandpa over.
There’s a surprise for him.

997
01:12:58,396 --> 01:13:01,437
Look…that’s him who has been
calling himself a superhero.

998
01:13:03,937 --> 01:13:04,937
And they…are aliens!

999
01:13:05,687 --> 01:13:07,437
Completely original;
just landed!

1000
01:13:08,896 --> 01:13:09,937
Attack!!

1001
01:13:10,312 --> 01:13:10,687
Huh..!!

1002
01:13:11,812 --> 01:13:13,312
How can we believe
that they are aliens?

1003
01:13:13,687 --> 01:13:16,812
Yes! We are aliens.
- Ya! We are aliens.

1004
01:13:17,062 --> 01:13:17,937
And we don’t lie.

1005
01:13:19,812 --> 01:13:20,437
Namaste !

1006
01:13:22,896 --> 01:13:23,562
Namskar !

1007
01:13:24,146 --> 01:13:24,937
We are from Superearth-

1008
01:13:25,187 --> 01:13:29,896
which is left from the moon, after 5 lakh kilometers
a right and then after two planets left again.

1009
01:13:32,187 --> 01:13:34,562
Upper or lower?
- Upper.

1010
01:13:34,812 --> 01:13:36,812
East or West?
- West.

1011
01:13:37,562 --> 01:13:40,812
Neighbourhood?
- PSX-03.

1012
01:13:41,312 --> 01:13:42,146
Ajar-Bajar?

1013
01:13:44,062 --> 01:13:46,562
Jiju (Brother-in-Law) !!!
Super!! He is the superhero!

1014
01:13:58,396 --> 01:13:59,936
Dad, you kept such
a huge thing from us;

1015
01:13:59,937 --> 01:14:00,771
that you are a superhero!!

1016
01:14:01,062 --> 01:14:02,562
Would you have believed
it if I had told you?

1017
01:14:03,146 --> 01:14:05,146
I told these two;
did you believe?

1018
01:14:06,021 --> 01:14:08,437
Keep on testing; making me run;
getting me to box!

1019
01:14:09,062 --> 01:14:12,062
Now see…both these aliens are
saying that I am a superhero!

1020
01:14:13,062 --> 01:14:14,062
Ask them!

1021
01:14:14,562 --> 01:14:15,521
Okay okay…
accepted.

1022
01:14:15,771 --> 01:14:17,812
But now that the aliens are here,
can you show us a little bit of flying?

1023
01:14:20,271 --> 01:14:21,062
How does one fly bro?

1024
01:14:21,312 --> 01:14:24,812
Don’t worry Jiju,
we will have you practice it; right?

1025
01:14:26,062 --> 01:14:27,437
Jiju?
- Jiju.

1026
01:14:28,146 --> 01:14:28,687
Jiju?

1027
01:14:29,937 --> 01:14:32,187
Our Sister still loves Jiju a lot.
Even now.

1028
01:14:33,062 --> 01:14:34,312
Even now.
- Even now.

1029
01:14:38,812 --> 01:14:39,521
Musi.

1030
01:14:40,521 --> 01:14:41,937
Yeahh…alien.

1031
01:14:42,437 --> 01:14:44,271
Orange candy…
- Yes.

1032
01:14:44,771 --> 01:14:46,937
Oh wow!
My mother in law is an alien?

1033
01:14:48,062 --> 01:14:49,062
Mother didn’t come?

1034
01:14:50,062 --> 01:14:51,021
She will be.

1035
01:14:51,187 --> 01:14:54,437
Oh wow! Now we have relatives
on another planet as well!!

1036
01:14:55,021 --> 01:14:57,937
Don’t make fun.
Your Earth is in danger.

1037
01:14:58,312 --> 01:14:59,937
You have to prepare for war now.

1038
01:15:01,062 --> 01:15:01,562
War ?

1039
01:15:02,437 --> 01:15:02,937
Attack.

1040
01:15:03,562 --> 01:15:04,812
There’s going to be an attack on Earth.

1041
01:15:05,437 --> 01:15:06,271
Why attack?

1042
01:15:06,937 --> 01:15:08,562
Dad…do you still have something
going on with the alien-mom?

1043
01:15:09,187 --> 01:15:10,812
No no...
she was just in my dreams yesterday.

1044
01:15:11,396 --> 01:15:12,187
That’s not the issue.

1045
01:15:12,437 --> 01:15:13,896
We have had a regime change.

1046
01:15:14,021 --> 01:15:15,812
The Army has taken
control over everything.

1047
01:15:16,812 --> 01:15:18,812
The people of our planet
want to capture Earth.

1048
01:15:19,437 --> 01:15:20,312
They have already left.

1049
01:15:20,896 --> 01:15:22,396
By the morning,
the attack would happen here.

1050
01:15:23,812 --> 01:15:24,687
Dad, let’s go from here.

1051
01:15:25,187 --> 01:15:27,312
Start Packing.
- Uncle! What are you saying?

1052
01:15:27,521 --> 01:15:28,562
Did we waste our time over nothing?

1053
01:15:29,021 --> 01:15:30,561
Now Grandpa will
definitely have to fight.

1054
01:15:30,562 --> 01:15:31,812
Hey!
You’ll fight?!

1055
01:15:32,062 --> 01:15:33,312
When did I say that
I am a superhero?

1056
01:15:33,437 --> 01:15:34,395
I don’t have any powers.

1057
01:15:34,396 --> 01:15:35,396
Dad, why did you
take the powers?

1058
01:15:35,562 --> 01:15:37,646
Couldn’t you have asked us once?
You want to play the hero too!

1059
01:15:38,187 --> 01:15:41,687
Uncle. The doctor has prohibited
him from lifting weights.

1060
01:15:42,062 --> 01:15:45,062
Back problem…knee problem…
BP…Sugar; he’s got them all.

1061
01:15:45,271 --> 01:15:47,312
Last time he had a fight
with the vegetable vendor

1062
01:15:47,562 --> 01:15:49,271
his BP was high for 2 days!

1063
01:15:51,187 --> 01:15:54,687
Dear niece, you will
have to fight this war.

1064
01:15:56,562 --> 01:15:59,937
He is indeed the true superhero of the Earth.
Only he has that power.

1065
01:16:01,271 --> 01:16:02,146
I have that power?

1066
01:16:02,312 --> 01:16:04,145
If not in you,
then not in anybody.

1067
01:16:04,146 --> 01:16:05,312
You are the protector of the Earth.

1068
01:16:05,687 --> 01:16:09,312
When you are the protector, why to fear?!

1069
01:16:16,062 --> 01:16:17,437
Tell me,
what is to be done.

1070
01:16:18,896 --> 01:16:19,937
First of all, you look up.

1071
01:16:22,937 --> 01:16:25,687
On your target;
till where you have to fly.

1072
01:16:28,687 --> 01:16:29,146
Good.

1073
01:16:29,771 --> 01:16:31,521
Now jump.
Then you will fly.

1074
01:16:33,396 --> 01:16:34,562
Hey..hey...
what are you saying bro.

1075
01:16:35,062 --> 01:16:35,896
Wanna get me killed or what?

1076
01:16:36,687 --> 01:16:37,812
Let’s go step by step.

1077
01:16:38,187 --> 01:16:41,937
First, 1 foot, then 10 feet
and then we’ll see.

1078
01:16:42,812 --> 01:16:44,312
If I look down,
then I get dizzy.

1079
01:16:44,562 --> 01:16:45,271
Oh don’t be afraid.

1080
01:16:45,437 --> 01:16:47,186
Firstly, think that
you are a superhero.

1081
01:16:47,187 --> 01:16:48,645
I have been thinking just
that since I was a kid.

1082
01:16:48,646 --> 01:16:50,812
Grandpa, not with doubt
but with confidence.

1083
01:16:51,062 --> 01:16:52,937
Now it is already proven
that you are a superhero.

1084
01:16:53,396 --> 01:16:54,771
Yes Dad!
You are a superhero!

1085
01:17:03,271 --> 01:17:04,521
Parrot…
- Fly!

1086
01:17:05,021 --> 01:17:06,312
Mynah…
- Fly!

1087
01:17:06,937 --> 01:17:08,021
Superhero!

1088
01:17:13,562 --> 01:17:15,311
Oh I can’t do it !
Not happening !

1089
01:17:15,312 --> 01:17:17,437
Seems like Grandpa’s
powers have expired.

1090
01:17:20,937 --> 01:17:22,562
That’s alright.
No worries.

1091
01:17:23,146 --> 01:17:24,646
This time we
will support a little.

1092
01:17:25,771 --> 01:17:28,645
3-2-1-
- Take Off!!

1093
01:17:28,646 --> 01:17:32,937
Bro..Aaaaarrghhh…
what are you doing?!

1094
01:17:33,062 --> 01:17:33,687
Deepu!!

1095
01:17:36,187 --> 01:17:39,396
Hey hey…get me down!
Get me down!!!!

1096
01:17:39,521 --> 01:17:40,312
VERY GOOD!

1097
01:17:40,687 --> 01:17:42,062
NOW YOU WILL HAVE
TO FLY ON YOUR OWN!

1098
01:17:42,312 --> 01:17:43,895
How do I fly on my own?!
Are you mad?!!

1099
01:17:43,896 --> 01:17:45,312
I AM STOPPING MY SUPPORT.

1100
01:17:45,771 --> 01:17:46,770
Deepu…
- OKAY?

1101
01:17:46,771 --> 01:17:48,062
Deepu…ask him
o get me down!!!

1102
01:17:48,187 --> 01:17:49,061
READY!
1-2-

1103
01:17:49,062 --> 01:17:51,436
Swear on your Sister…
- FLYYYY!!!

1104
01:17:51,437 --> 01:17:54,437
Aargghhhhh.!!!!!

1105
01:17:59,062 --> 01:18:00,146
A little further lower bro!

1106
01:18:02,312 --> 01:18:04,646
Killed me!
Broke my back...

1107
01:18:05,521 --> 01:18:07,812
You should meet
Saksham’s grandpa once too.

1108
01:18:08,271 --> 01:18:09,812
I think he might be the superhero.

1109
01:18:10,312 --> 01:18:11,687
Else, we will be
in trouble tomorrow.

1110
01:18:16,271 --> 01:18:18,271
Painkiller…would be a little relief.

1111
01:18:19,021 --> 01:18:21,271
I feel that his powers
will manifest only in battle.

1112
01:18:22,271 --> 01:18:25,395
Alien uncle,
give these powers to me, I’ll manage.

1113
01:18:25,396 --> 01:18:28,771
Hey hey…power is given upon
seeing the worth of a person;

1114
01:18:29,021 --> 01:18:29,896
it’s not a mere offering

1115
01:18:31,271 --> 01:18:32,646
Grandpa…what are you doing?

1116
01:18:32,771 --> 01:18:35,146
Get up!
Rouse your powers.

1117
01:18:35,521 --> 01:18:38,145
You have the power!
You are a SUPERHERO!!

1118
01:18:38,146 --> 01:18:41,146
Grandpa!!
Wake up your POWER!!!!

1119
01:18:41,396 --> 01:18:43,021
WAKE IT UP!!!

1120
01:18:44,146 --> 01:18:45,021
You are right.

1121
01:18:46,271 --> 01:18:48,021
If not now, then never.

1122
01:18:48,771 --> 01:18:50,021
I’ll get martyred

1123
01:18:52,146 --> 01:18:54,521
Dad, why will YOU get martyred?
I will get martyred.

1124
01:18:54,896 --> 01:18:57,021
Uncle, we can’t get emotional.
We will have to be practical.

1125
01:18:57,271 --> 01:18:59,271
You are not the superhero.
He is.

1126
01:19:00,146 --> 01:19:01,146
You can get martyred.

1127
01:19:02,021 --> 01:19:04,771
Everyone will have to be told that
they shouldn’t get out of their homes tomorrow.

1128
01:19:06,521 --> 01:19:07,521
This task I will do.

1129
01:19:07,646 --> 01:19:12,896
as you can see,
how it was just word earlier,

1130
01:19:13,146 --> 01:19:16,146
and then curses started,
and now it’s a fistfight.

1131
01:19:16,396 --> 01:19:17,521
Brother, how are you feeling?

1132
01:19:17,646 --> 01:19:19,271
Umm…err..it feels very nice.

1133
01:19:19,646 --> 01:19:22,021
Earlier when they were not fighting,
it was a bit boring.

1134
01:19:22,396 --> 01:19:26,396
But when uncle slapped,
it was very nice, very interesting sir!

1135
01:19:26,646 --> 01:19:27,896
Oh Dad!
What are you doing?

1136
01:19:28,271 --> 01:19:30,020
Son, I am war-reporting.

1137
01:19:30,021 --> 01:19:32,146
But dad, real war is
happening there; come quickly!

1138
01:19:32,396 --> 01:19:33,021
Let’s go.

1139
01:19:36,646 --> 01:19:38,146
Dad! This is alien uncle.

1140
01:19:41,771 --> 01:19:43,396
Namaste !
- Namaste !

1141
01:19:44,271 --> 01:19:45,896
I am Khulasa and war-reporter.

1142
01:19:47,146 --> 01:19:49,021
The kids were scared.
- Thank you.

1143
01:19:49,271 --> 01:19:52,646
He was saying that there’s going
to be an attack on Earth tomorrow?

1144
01:19:52,896 --> 01:19:53,771
You heard it right.

1145
01:19:54,646 --> 01:19:56,896
You want to do an exposé?
- Yes.

1146
01:19:58,396 --> 01:19:59,271
Switch on your camera.

1147
01:20:00,021 --> 01:20:00,521
Sure

1148
01:20:09,271 --> 01:20:11,396
Ohh…this has become…
kind of different!

1149
01:20:11,896 --> 01:20:14,271
As in, it is kind of ghost-like.

1150
01:20:14,521 --> 01:20:18,896
As in, ghosts too are invisible on camera
but can be seen otherwise.

1151
01:20:27,146 --> 01:20:29,020
Up…up...
Yess…one more…

1152
01:20:29,021 --> 01:20:31,646
Didn’t I tell you, he’s the superhero.
He will save us from the attack tomorrow.

1153
01:20:32,521 --> 01:20:34,021
Aaarghh…

1154
01:20:36,771 --> 01:20:39,021
Well, now that you are saying it,
then let’s believe it!

1155
01:20:41,146 --> 01:20:42,646
Nice to meet you sir.

1156
01:20:42,771 --> 01:20:43,646
Mr. Khulasa...

1157
01:20:44,771 --> 01:20:46,021
...please help us.

1158
01:20:47,021 --> 01:20:51,146
Please tell everyone not to
leave their homes after 8. Please.

1159
01:20:52,271 --> 01:20:53,771
Not 8, they are coming at 9.

1160
01:20:54,146 --> 01:20:58,271
Oh Nanu (grandpa)...only if we say 8
then people will be indoors by 9.

1161
01:20:58,521 --> 01:20:59,270
This is India.

1162
01:20:59,271 --> 01:21:02,271
Oh nice, interesting fact!
I didn’t know that.

1163
01:21:02,521 --> 01:21:03,396
Now, c’mon…

1164
01:21:05,896 --> 01:21:07,271
Can I ask a question?

1165
01:21:07,396 --> 01:21:08,021
Yes.

1166
01:21:08,271 --> 01:21:11,396
Why do you always
come to ATTACK the Earth?

1167
01:21:11,646 --> 01:21:14,396
No. Never.
We have never attacked Earth.

1168
01:21:14,646 --> 01:21:17,021
This has always been our favourite planet.

1169
01:21:17,396 --> 01:21:20,396
It has water, air, plants
and trees, and life.

1170
01:21:20,646 --> 01:21:22,396
Many years ago,
we used to live here only.

1171
01:21:22,646 --> 01:21:26,521
The grandfather of our great grandfather had
2 personal dinosaurs of his own- Hira & Moti.

1172
01:21:26,646 --> 01:21:29,771
But when asteroids crashed here,
we had to vacate out of fear.

1173
01:21:29,896 --> 01:21:31,396
And we settled a new planet of our own.

1174
01:21:31,646 --> 01:21:33,396
Be practical.
Be practical.

1175
01:21:34,146 --> 01:21:37,021
But the people of our planet feel
that you all don’t care for your Earth.

1176
01:21:37,646 --> 01:21:40,896
You cut down trees,
spread filth and trash.

1177
01:21:41,271 --> 01:21:43,896
But…for this, why are you coming to
fight all the way from so very far?

1178
01:21:44,146 --> 01:21:45,521
We will take care of it.

1179
01:21:46,396 --> 01:21:50,395
I’ll just make an awareness video
on social media and that’s that!

1180
01:21:50,396 --> 01:21:50,896
No.

1181
01:21:51,646 --> 01:21:52,896
It’s gotten much worse.

1182
01:21:53,146 --> 01:21:55,271
We feel that you all are
not worthy of Earth.

1183
01:21:55,896 --> 01:21:58,021
That’s why they are coming
to remove you from Earth.

1184
01:21:59,896 --> 01:22:02,521
Then…what can we do?
- Fight.

1185
01:22:03,021 --> 01:22:04,771
If you win,
then maintain cleanliness.

1186
01:22:05,021 --> 01:22:06,271
And if you don’t win then…
- Then…

1187
01:22:06,646 --> 01:22:08,146
They will clean us up!

1188
01:22:08,396 --> 01:22:09,396
Yeah, correct.

1189
01:22:10,521 --> 01:22:12,521
And, HE’s the one to save us?!

1190
01:22:14,146 --> 01:22:18,021
Do you happen to
have a special approach?

1191
01:22:18,271 --> 01:22:20,521
Not yet, but maybe
he’ll have it at the time of battle.

1192
01:22:22,396 --> 01:22:23,771
And if you don’t get it?

1193
01:22:25,771 --> 01:22:26,521
I’ll fight;

1194
01:22:27,646 --> 01:22:32,521
with whatever strength I have.

1195
01:22:34,021 --> 01:22:35,146
This is the chance.

1196
01:22:37,521 --> 01:22:42,521
Since childhood I was waiting to do something
that would make everyone say wow.

1197
01:22:44,021 --> 01:22:46,396
Mother used to say that,
when opportunity comes,

1198
01:22:47,396 --> 01:22:48,521
then never step back.

1199
01:22:50,771 --> 01:23:00,396
Do something so good that people say,
‘Wow! What a deed!’

1200
01:23:05,021 --> 01:23:07,646
It’s not important if
I have power or don’t have it.

1201
01:23:09,521 --> 01:23:13,771
They are coming to fight ME,
that’s important.

1202
01:23:14,521 --> 01:23:16,396
Tomorrow if I fall during the fight,

1203
01:23:16,771 --> 01:23:21,396
then before I die, do come
and say ‘Bravo’ in my ear.

1204
01:23:22,021 --> 01:23:25,020
I have no desire of being a superhero.

1205
01:23:25,021 --> 01:23:27,021
But I do like hearing my praise.

1206
01:23:32,646 --> 01:23:35,146
Sorry grandpa...
- What happened? why are you crying ?

1207
01:23:35,271 --> 01:23:36,271
Hey... Hey Laddu !

1208
01:23:37,521 --> 01:23:38,771
Hey laddu,
Where are you going?

1209
01:23:58,771 --> 01:24:01,521
Nothing will happen to Grandpa, right?

1210
01:24:04,521 --> 01:24:06,396
I don’t want this fight.

1211
01:24:07,271 --> 01:24:09,896
I am fine with
just listening to stories.

1212
01:24:49,521 --> 01:24:53,021
It is time.
You will have to save everyone tomorrow.

1213
01:24:57,771 --> 01:24:59,396
Only you can save.

1214
01:25:53,271 --> 01:25:54,646
Dad, please give me 20 rupees.

1215
01:25:56,521 --> 01:25:57,896
It’s a bit urgent.
But I will return it.

1216
01:26:06,771 --> 01:26:09,646
Had stolen one day.
Returning it now.

1217
01:26:19,771 --> 01:26:22,146
God! Please take care
of things tomorrow.

1218
01:26:44,146 --> 01:26:47,271
Grandpa…
- Yes.

1219
01:26:48,146 --> 01:26:49,271
It is 7:15.

1220
01:26:58,396 --> 01:27:01,896
Dad, come back a winner.
And take care of your back.

1221
01:27:18,771 --> 01:27:19,646
What are you doing here dear?

1222
01:27:20,271 --> 01:27:23,396
Can I come with you too?
I want to fight too.

1223
01:27:42,021 --> 01:27:43,021
Not visible yet.

1224
01:27:45,521 --> 01:27:49,521
Are they cancelling their plan?!
I have even declared it on my channel!

1225
